.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: eliminate remaining hero layout shift from theme and breakpoint hydration\n\n- Add inline script to _document.tsx to set the correct theme class before\n  React hydrates, preventing any post-paint DOM update for theme\n- Initialize useTheme and ThemeToggle state synchronously from the DOM so\n  the first render is already correct (no logo swap flash for dark mode)\n- Replace useBreakpoints-based ThemeToggle visibility in Hero with CSS\n  media query so the element is never conditionally mounted, eliminating\n  the hydration mismatch that caused the toggle to pop in on desktop\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01KFQSxdF3twAcR4xihDeyqk","tree":{"sha":"23407c478fa921e8f7f25d08fd684a5a24c962c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/glrodasz/vitae/git/trees/23407c478fa921e8f7f25d08fd684a5a24c962c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/glrodasz/vitae/git/commits/7f213f08837dcc7f51c713ca26fc9631770116dd","verification":{"payload":"tree 23407c478fa921e8f7f25d08fd684a5a24c962c4\nparent 63ce8b5fbf1ba2d7940ca6f6e21c5fc7ceddb645\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1775561174 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1775561174 +0000\n\nfix: eliminate remaining hero layout shift from theme and breakpoint hydration\n\n- Add inline script to _document.tsx to set the correct theme class before\n  React hydrates, preventing any post-paint DOM update for theme\n- Initialize useTheme and ThemeToggle state synchronously from the DOM so\n  the first render is already correct (no logo swap flash for dark mode)\n- Replace useBreakpoints-based ThemeToggle visibility in Hero with CSS\n  media query so the element is never conditionally mounted, eliminating\n  the hydration mismatch that caused the toggle to pop in on desktop\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01KFQSxdF3twAcR4xihDeyqk\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAA