"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"message":"perf(budget): stop rolling months once the carry settles\n\nstartFrom() now walks every calendar month from the touched one (quiet\nmonths too, so the carry chain never breaks) and stops re-rolling once a\nmonth''s carry into the next comes out unchanged. The current month is\nalways rolled.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"120549fd75fa87dd4b1c6132b9efa20e8bea5a05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/120549fd75fa87dd4b1c6132b9efa20e8bea5a05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/commits/0caca0f6a1fed6e11534d01b123c6aa8d8852602","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commit/0caca0f6a1fed6e11534d01b123c6aa8d8852602","node_id":"C_kwDOFJBLONoAKDBjYWNh