eService persists refreshed tokens and throws GoogleReauthorizationRequired\n  only on invalid_grant/invalid_client; transient refresh failures stay ''fetch''\n- GoogleCalendarService maps 401 -> reauth, 403 insufficientPermissions -> scope,\n  everything else -> fetch, and converts event times to the requested timezone\n- RoutineController uses the team timezone for ''now'', the week anchor and\n  calendar clashes; week exceptions compare by date string so Sunday is\n  included and next Monday excluded\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8763e10ab9c8fb9cf802cc027e49e7ff3e369812","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/8763e10ab9c8fb9cf802cc027e49e7ff3e369812"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/commits/a3193fc07a952230c03eb5737d022a968047df32","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"