":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"message":"chore(deps): upgrade to Laravel 13\n\n- laravel/framework ^13.0 (13.34), PHP ^8.3, inertia-laravel 3, PHPUnit 12\n  (schema bump), nwidart/laravel-modules 13 (republished config/modules.php)\n- Own packages on their L13-compatible branches: treasurer and\n  watchlist-module on dev-laravel-13, atmosphere on dev-inertia-v2-compat\n- CSRF middleware extends PreventRequestForgery (VerifyCsrfToken is deprecated)\n- Carbon 3: diffIn*() returns a signed float and is no longer absolute by\n  default; cast to int and pass `true` where the old absolute value was used\n- brick/math: RoundingMode::HALF_UP/HALF_EVEN -> HalfUp/HalfEven\n- Tests: #[Test] attributes instead of /** @test */, withoutVite() in the\n  base TestCase, and RouteNamesTest now runs route:cache before route:clear\n  (PendingCommand runs on destruct, so the cache leaked into later tests)\n\nFull suite: 505 tests, 50 failures, all identical on the pre-upgrade\nLaravel 11.55 checkout (stale TodayPageTest, missing Account/BudgetTarget\nfactories, unit tests using Eloquent without the app).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ef9052b13e6cb7b4e967e69933a0acf93ad9733f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/ef9052b13e6cb7b4e967e69933a0acf93ad9733f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/commits/e81caa9185646116635b8c85ecc7852dcb9b1641","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","