com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/1f0afec5d25566bcfda9d9ce17f54fc74dd69e83/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T21:53:48Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T21:53:48Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"message":"fix(insights): \"Por Beneficiario\" honors the range toolbar\n\nEl desglose por beneficiario (payeesOut / payeesIn) estaba anclado al último\nmes con datos en vez de usar el rango seleccionado, así que al elegir \"1 año\"\nseguía mostrando solo el mes actual (p. ej. –DOP 7,793.51 con 3 beneficiarios),\nmientras \"Por Categoría\" sí mostraba el año — los dos paneles no cuadraban.\n\nAhora payeesOut/payeesIn usan $startDate..$endDate, la misma ventana que el\ndesglose por categoría ($groups), para que Categoría y Beneficiario reconcilien\nen cualquier rango. Se elimina el anclaje $anchor/$breakStart/$breakEnd.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015zMZvSJ4BK7ZQu5E6pTXvJ","tree":{"sha":"55380e00b4f4ea182c3fcb5b7b630360c8f56876","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/55380e00b4f4ea182c3fcb5b7b630360c8f56876"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/commits/1f0afec5d25566bcfda