MTM2NTAwZTU3MDFhZDdkNmM1YWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commit/ae510db9d7699ad089ef65b34b81bd6962aa4cda","sha":"ae510db9d7699ad089ef65b34b81bd6962aa4cda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/ae510db9d7699ad089ef65b34b81bd6962aa4cda"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commit/c32ca9133776e54c26b3ba07f4a9dc565da58401","sha":"c32ca9133776e54c26b3ba07f4a9dc565da58401","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/c32ca9133776e54c26b3ba07f4a9dc565da58401"}],"sha":"fc8ee2b16fa67b16bfed136500e5701ad7d6c5ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/fc8ee2b16fa67b16bfed136500e5701ad7d6c5ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/c32ca9133776e54c26b3ba07f4a9dc565da58401/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T16:28:21Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T16:28:21Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"message":"refactor(dashboard): right rail as glance+act only; promote Accounts & Watchlists\n\nEl right rail mezclaba tipos de uso: \"Cuentas\" y \"Seguimiento\" eran listas\npara explorar (tipo B) que al hacer click te sacaban del Dashboard y mataban\nel contexto — mientras Presupuesto, Tarjetas y Lista son glance + acción\ninline (tipo A), que es lo que el rail debe ser.\n\n- Rail (FinanceWidget.vue): quita las tabs \"Cuentas\" y \"Seguimiento\".\n  Quedan 3: Presupuesto / Tarjetas de crédito / Lista de compras. Enfoque:\n  money flow + shopping list.\n- Dashboard (DashboardSummary.vue): sube AccountBalancesWidget a una fila\n  prominente después de los stat tiles (ya no al final de la columna), y\n  agrega WatchlistDashboardWidget (se auto-oculta si no hay watchlists),\n  ambos promovidos desde el rail. Los grupos de cuentas colapsan inline;\n  solo una cuenta o \"View all\" navega — glance view, no trampa de navegación.\n- AccountBalancesWidget: footer \"View all →\" a /finance para conservar el\n  deep-nav de la vieja tab \"Cuentas\".\n- Fix tile \"Presupuesto\": mostraba \"Sin presupuesto · Crea tu primer\n  presupuesto\" aunque el usuario tuviera presupuesto, porque solo miraba el\n  monto asignado del mes (0 al empezar un mes nuevo). Ahora el controller\n  pasa budgetConfigured (existe algún budget_target del team) y el tile\n  distingue 3 estados: con asignación → % gastado; presupuesto pero sin\n  asignar este mes → \"Nada asignado este mes · Asignar →\"; sin presupuesto →\n  \"Crea tu primer presupuesto\". Se mantiene el guardia anti-Infinity%.\n\nNota: budgetConfigured usa la existencia de budget_targets; no pude correrlo\ncontra la DB desde aquí — verificar el tile tras yarn build.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015zMZvSJ4BK7ZQu5E6pTXvJ","tree":{"sha":"c25045d601ebfaaa0ecbd88fdbd10924f1d9c257","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/c25045d601ebfaaa0ecbd88fdbd10924f1d9c257"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/commits/c32ca9133776e54c26b3ba07f4a9dc565da58401","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commit/c32ca9133776e54c26b3ba07f4a9dc565da58401","node_id":"C_kwDOFJBLONoAKGMzMmNhOTEzMzc3NmU1NGMyNmIzYmEwN2Y0YTlkYzU2NWRhNTg0MDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commit/c729725d5387756492e9146ff65084db6f7a5d8e","sha":"c729725d5387756492e9146ff65084db6f7a5d8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/c729725d5387756492e9146ff65084db6f7a5d8e"}],"sha":"c32ca9133776e54c26b3ba07f4a9dc565da58401","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/c32ca9133776e54c26b3ba07f4a9dc565da58401"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/c729725d5387756492e9146ff65084db6f7a5d8e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T05:10:56Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T05:10:56Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"message":"feat(reconciliation): \"book difference & finish\" on the detail page\n\nPonerse al día con una tarjeta atrasada se trababa cuando quedaba una\ndiferencia que no se podía rastrear línea por línea. El botón para\nregistrar esa diferencia como ajuste y cerrar la conciliación solo existía\nen el banner de la cuenta, no en la pantalla de detalle donde se trabaja.\n\n- Show.vue: botón \"Ajustar y cerrar\" (visible cuando está pendiente y hay\n  diferencia != 0) con modal de confirmación que muestra el monto; manda el\n  saldo del estado de cuenta que está en pantalla.\n- ReconciliationService::saveAdjustment: ahora recibe el balance y recalcula\n  la diferencia desde lo que ve el usuario (no un valor viejo). El ajuste se\n  fecha en la fecha del estado de cuenta para que balanceAsOf() cuadre de\n  verdad y el próximo mes parta de un saldo correcto. Completa vía\n  syncTransactions()/addEntries() en vez del addEntry() del vendor, que\n  referencia un $items indefinido y nunca recalculaba la diferencia.\n- Controller::adjustment: arma ReconciliationParamsData y redirige al detalle\n  para que se vea el estado completado.\n\nNota: el bug real de addEntry() vive en el paquete insane/journal\n(atmosphere-core), no en este repo; aquí se evita por completo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015zMZvSJ4BK7ZQu5E6pTXvJ","tree":{"sha":"8edcf425a0e74a17d4a3b5789dd371e91a21f1b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/8edcf425a0e74a17d4a3b5789dd371e91a21f1b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/commits/c729725d5387756492e9146ff65084db6f7a5d8e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commit/c729725d5387756492e9146ff65084db6f7a5d8e","node_id":"C_kwDOFJBLONoAKGM3Mjk3MjVkNTM4Nzc1NjQ5MmU5MTQ2ZmY2NTA4NGRiNmY3YTVkOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commit/fbb2f5310cc82eab4c9dec375dbd24a237fa0bda","sha":"fbb2f5310cc82eab4c9dec375dbd24a237fa0bda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/fbb2f5310cc82eab4c9dec375dbd24a237fa0bda"}],"sha":"c729725d5387756492e9146ff65084db6f7a5d8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/c729725d5387756492e9146ff65084db6f7a5d8e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/fbb2f5310cc82eab4c9dec375dbd24a237fa0bda/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T05:08:42Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T05:08:42Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"message":"fix(accounts): make reconciled/unreconciled filters actually filter\n\nThe \"Todas / Conciliadas / Sin conciliar\" filters never filtered:\nreconciliation_last.amount comes from the API as a decimal string while\naccount.balance is a number, so the strict `amount === balance` check was\nalways false — \"Conciliadas\" matched nothing and \"Sin conciliar\" matched\nevery account. Compare numerically with a cent tolerance via a shared\nisAccountReconciled() helper.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xp2xmgoUCYiWqP8rnAs6en","tree":{"sha":"4d5f3be10b482523bc52d6c1b00df6f698e5a876","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/4d5f3be10b482523bc52d6c1b00df6f698e5a876"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/commits/fbb2f5310cc82eab4c9dec375dbd24a237fa0bda","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j