/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/79ed656689dc9224ce043fd35f11348d4f62d01b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T05:05:03Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T05:05:03Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"message":"feat(credit-cards): show days since last unpaid statement cut\n\nSurface, in both Próximos Pagos and the credit card visuals, how many days\nhave elapsed since the last statement cut that closed without being paid off.\n\n- NextPaymentsService: expose cut_date + statement_unpaid on credit card\n  payment items\n- CreditCardSummaryController: add cut_at, days_since_cut, statement_unpaid\n  to the payInFull payload (days_since_cut is null when the statement is\n  settled, so the UI only badges cards with an open, unpaid cut)\n- NextPaymentItem: \"{days}d del corte\" badge on credit card rows\n- CreditCardsLedger/CreditCardItem: fetch the summary and show\n  \"Corte hace {days}d · sin pagar\" on each card\n- es.json: Spanish strings\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xp2xmgoUCYiWqP8rnAs6en","tree":{"sha":"a5cf8fb6618629825b646da4aaf19ab45defa5fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/a5cf8fb6618629825b646da4aaf19ab45defa5fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/commits/79ed656689dc9224ce043fd35f11348d4f62d01b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantgu