om/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/9ea44bcfddbd4b4a2e44fdcc23c0c07dac9e3280/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T09:57:14Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T09:57:14Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"message":"fix(security): close cross-team writes/reads and require 2FA for API tokens\n\n- Bulk category/account updates only touch the current team''s rows and\n  never take team_id/user_id from the request.\n- Accounts: the show policy compares teams; close, link-bank,\n  automation-service link, multi-currency balances and payment linking\n  authorize; integration_id must belong to the team. The denied-show\n  redirect pointed at a missing route (500); it now goes to transactions.\n- Reconciliation actions all authorize; the ignored `adjust` check now\n  aborts and entries must belong to the reconciliation.\n- Next payments mark-as-paid resolves targets within the team and scopes\n  the account/payee exists rules.\n- SearchTransactions filters by the occurrence''s team; occurrence routes\n  404 outside the team.\n- Journal transaction create/update reject accounts, payees and\n  categories of other teams (EnsuresTeamReferences); update pins team_id.\n- Multi-currency transactions/payments validate team ownership.\n- Loger profiles 404 outside the team and take the team from the profile.\n- /api/sanctum/token requires a TOTP or recovery code when 2FA is on.\n- Board task descriptions render as text instead of v-html (stored XSS).\n- Bump insane/plan-module (b08c8a2) and insane/watchlist-module (f476fc5)\n  with their team scoping fixes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"392df606644ce1ac6cbc26061fbec3e77c31542e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/392df606644ce1ac6cbc26061fbec3e77c31542e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/commits/9ea44bcfddbd4b4a2e44fdcc23c0c07dac9e3280","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commit/9ea44bcfddbd4b4a2e44fdcc23c0c07dac9e3280","node_id":"C_kwDOFJBLONoAKDllYTQ0YmNmZGRiZDRiNGEyZTQ0ZmRjYzI