1b","sha":"e82c821a14928cb2a8e68d4e8a6b296f0eafba1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/e82c821a14928cb2a8e68d4e8a6b296f0eafba1b"}],"sha":"40aafe07f8bffa1cb0c65157f4f50df45fb9db6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/40aafe07f8bffa1cb0c65157f4f50df45fb9db6d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/e82c821a14928cb2a8e68d4e8a6b296f0eafba1b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T16:04:49Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T16:04:49Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"message":"dashboard: cada tarjeta de atención lleva a su lista filtrada\n\nLas tres tarjetas de \"Qué necesita tu atención hoy\" contaban items pero\nsus enlaces no llevaban a esos items exactos. Ahora cada enlace aterriza\nen una lista filtrada a exactamente lo que la tarjeta contó.\n\n- Pagos vencidos / próximos: los \"next payments\" son una mezcla sintética\n  (recordatorios de presupuesto + cortes de tarjeta + transacciones\n  planificadas) que ningún filtro de /finance/transactions puede\n  reproducir. Se agrega una página dedicada /finance/next-payments que\n  reduce la MISMA fuente (NextPaymentsService) con el MISMO predicado de\n  fecha del hero (antes de hoy = vencido; hoy..+7 = próximo), así la lista\n  muestra exactamente los items contados.\n- Recordatorios vencidos: /housing/occurrence?overdue=1 filtra la lista al\n  mismo umbral que el dashboard y el widget (días desde el último >=\n  promedio + 3). Se agrega una pestaña \"Overdue\".\n- Transacciones por revisar: ya llevaba a /inbox (correcto). Se corrige el\n  singular/plural de las cuatro etiquetas del hero (\"1 transacción por\n  revisar\", no \"1 transacciones\").\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015zMZvSJ4BK7ZQu5E6pTXvJ","tree":{"sha":"f1937d5a691058b3aab8f415fbd66dd66d967628","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/f1937d5a691058b3aab8f415fbd66dd66d967628"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/commits/e82c821a14928cb2a8e68d4e8a6b296f0eafba1b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github