ro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/5151dae9f83169866d8fb0ed9f8f7a6f23a07baa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T04:24:26Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T04:24:26Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"message":"perf(budget): collapse burst rollovers into one unique job per team+month\n\nEvery verified transaction event ran the full rollover inline in its\nlistener, so a bank import of N transactions ran N rollovers in series.\nListeners now dispatch RollBudgetForward, unique per team+month while it\nwaits in the queue; the lock is released when processing starts so a\ntransaction saved mid-rollover still queues a trailing run.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"98b8f2395b6f3b1893c4402dc05c56998e2da44e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/98b8f2395b6f3b1893c4402dc05c56998e2da44e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/commits/5151dae9f83169866d8fb0ed9f8f7a6f23a07baa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.