7421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/3ff5782bc4ee99d8e54defdf5caba0d45a140d04/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T14:43:20Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T14:43:20Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"message":"fix(budget): rollover added |activity| with the wrong sign for inflows\n\n`BudgetRolloverService::getAvailableInMonth` computed\n`available = budgeted + left_from_last_month - abs(activity)`, so an inflow\ncategorized directly into a normal category (positive activity) was\nsubtracted instead of added. The error then compounded every month through\n`left_from_last_month` (team 16 \"Interest\" drifted $0.64 since 2025-06).\n\nUse the signed activity, matching `BudgetCategoryService::getBudgetInfo`\nand the LM-4 frontend fix that already removed the same formula.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"41937117ea6d1cde7bb7ba548a29c18b61f2c6bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/41937117ea6d1cde7bb7ba548a29c18b61f2c6bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/commits/3ff5782bc4ee99d8e54defdf5caba0d45a140d04","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committe