":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/c4226bfc01cf4dffc5878dcb7d8f675ca063eac3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T03:26:16Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T03:26:16Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"message":"fix(transactions): show description in account/payee tables\n\nThe account and payee transaction tables (tableAccountCols) had dropped the\nDescription column into a tooltip, assuming it''s redundant with the payee. But\nbank-synced rows often have no payee — the description holds the real content —\nso it disappeared, and no-payee rows were even mislabeled as transfers.\n\nThe Payee cell now shows the description: as a muted secondary line under the\npayee when both exist, and as the primary line (instead of a bogus transfer)\nwhen there is no payee. Transfers are unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015zMZvSJ4BK7ZQu5E6pTXvJ","tree":{"sha":"758c5156232b9f8a8c7463ca436b0955f140f783","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/758c5156232b9f8a8c7463ca436b0955f140f783"},"url":"https://api