esusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/e5188e458821370b5b32df759914fb59fd2144a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T03:48:01Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T03:48:01Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"message":"fix(budget): stop Spent/Available number overlap in the table\n\nWiden the Available column w-28 -> w-36 across the item row, group header,\ntotals row and the column labels. In overspent rows the bold Available amount\nplus its inline action icon exceeded the 112px column and spilled left into the\nright-aligned Spent number, colliding by ~11px. w-36 fits the widest\nnumber+icon and restores a >=21px gap (measured on the live table). Keeps Spent\nright-aligned; column widths stay in lockstep across all four spots.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015zMZvSJ4BK7ZQu5E6pTXvJ","tree":{"sha":"998ffcd307aa045cd03caf88b8685e2b91ed4086","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/998ffcd307aa045cd03caf88b8685e2b91ed4086"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/commits/e5188e458821370b5b32df759914fb59fd2144a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.gi