/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/6f3ff14cba237af730594cea4dc4e20b6a245844/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T03:40:11Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T03:40:11Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"message":"polish(budget): loan-target review fixes + calmer name input\n\nApplies the code-review findings:\n- Payoff bar now uses payment-count progress (percentByPayments) so it agrees\n  with the ''k/n paid'' label instead of principal-reduction, which lagged.\n- Loan card shows a payoff date (start + term) and no longer renders ''by '' with\n  an empty date for targets that have no date.\n- Target form clears the auto-computed amount when switching away from Loan, so\n  it isn''t mistaken for a manual amount on the new type.\n- Fix BudgetTargetTypes.SavingMonthly enum value (''saving_monthly'' -> ''savings_monthly'').\n- Add server-side validation on the target endpoints for amount + loan fields\n  (non-negative, numeric, sane bounds); additive so other target types are\n  unaffected.\n\nAlso: the category-name input in the detail panel is now borderless, so the\nAtInput default gray/indigo (and the earlier coral) focus border no longer\ndraws a heavy box — a subtle bg fill on hover/focus carries the affordance.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015zMZvSJ4BK7ZQu5E6pTXvJ","tree":{