uerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/cc98d084ed8b935a7692e6dc1eae070f1a339eb1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T16:14:52Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T16:14:52Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"message":"feat(budget): loan target with computed payment + payoff tracking\n\n- New ''loan'' budget target type. You enter the loan amount, annual rate and\n  term; the amortized monthly payment is computed and stored in the target''s\n  amount, so it funds like any MONTHLY obligation. Migration adds principal,\n  interest_rate, term_months, loan_start_date (+ ''loan'' enum value); the model\n  fills/casts them.\n- Payoff tracking (client-side amortization in loan.ts): the target card shows\n  the monthly payment, the loan terms, a payoff progress bar and the remaining\n  balance / payments made, derived from the stored terms and start date.\n- Polish: category-name input in the detail form no longer turns coral on hover\n  (text-body + subtle base-lvl-2 hover, matching the note field); target card\n  header is neutral (text-body) and i18n''d instead of hardcoded red English.\n- Add en/es strings for the loan fields, payoff labels and target header.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015zMZvSJ4BK7ZQu5E6pTXvJ","tree":{"sha":"eed5942326902f7849a0dd5d9b1a4053ab1cfe8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/eed5942326902f7849a0dd5d9b1a4053ab1cfe8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/commits/cc98d084ed8b935a7692e6dc1eae070f1a339eb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"htt