url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/5e0a5bcca7b31a6a82d682e82e58158a69fd21ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T11:13:22Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T11:13:22Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"message":"fix(layout): symmetric right gutter + search on mobile\n\n- Page content reserved only ~64px on the right (shell) while the fixed\n  FinanceWidget rail is 76px, so content overran the rail by ~12px and the\n  right gutter never matched the left. Add lg:pr-3 to the content main to\n  close the gap; both gutters now land flush to their rails. Verified in\n  the browser across padding values.\n- Global search (AppResourceSearch) was hidden below md, leaving mobile\n  with no search entry point. Un-hide it; the trigger already collapses to\n  an icon-only button under lg, so mobile gets a clean search icon that\n  opens the same command modal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015zMZvSJ4BK7ZQu5E6pTXvJ","tree":{"sha":"b518af65c20288aaf3655f838ac097679642749b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/b518af65c20288aaf3655f838ac097679642749b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusa