anish i18n for the food module\n\nIngredients tab was blank with no way to add an ingredient (its only\nbutton was a misplaced ''New Meal'', and the create page Ingredients/Form\ndoesn''t exist), so a fresh space could never seed ingredients -> recipes\nand shopping lists had nothing to work with. Add an inline ''add\ningredient'' (header + empty state) that POSTs to /api/ingredients and\nreloads -- the same API the page already used for labels.\n\ni18n: the Create-recipe form and a few loose strings were hardcoded\nEnglish. Wrap them in $t across MealForm, MealFormLine, Create, Planner\n(Add to shopping list / Ingredients this week) and the Transactions\nimport/export menu, and add the missing es/en keys. ''Logged'' and\n''No accounts found.'' already used $t and just needed the translation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015zMZvSJ4BK7ZQu5E6pTXvJ","tree":{"sha":"847f505b1d2dff39b0cc696b89c88d29b940a01f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/847f505b1d2dff39b0cc696b89c88d29b940a01f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/commits/bdad81dc393440f183585ecbb35217ff0b78566a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesu