10:21Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"message":"fix(auth): surface Forgot-password link on the login page\n\nPassword reset is enabled in Fortify and the ForgotPassword/ResetPassword\npages exist, but the login screen never linked to them (it only passed an\nunused canResetPassword prop), so users who forgot their password had no\nway in. Add a ''Forgot your password?'' link via AtAuthForm''s #more-actions\nslot, gated on canResetPassword, pointing at the password.request route.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015zMZvSJ4BK7ZQu5E6pTXvJ","tree":{"sha":"459ba5246c3e767b19f2b21e625429ec96aa08e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/459ba5246c3e767b19f2b21e625429ec96aa08e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/commits/ee27a1693455e31c7410cba14761e8f6964ec5bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","typ