sus Guerrero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T13:04:49Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"message":"feat(ux): friendly toast instead of Inertia raw error modal\n\nA gateway/server hiccup (nginx 502/503/504), a dropped connection, or an\nexpired session (419) made Inertia pop its default full-page error modal\nshowing the raw HTML (the white ''502 Bad Gateway'' sheet). Intercept the\nrouter ''invalid'' and ''exception'' events, preventDefault to suppress that\nmodal, and show a friendly ElNotification toast instead. In dev the modal\nis kept for genuine app errors (500) so the Laravel stack trace stays\nvisible; gateway/session errors always become a toast.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015zMZvSJ4BK7ZQu5E6pTXvJ","tree":{"sha":"cee3dcb4c73f6f4c95e4e2d8893424e38383245d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/cee3dcb4c73f6f4c95e4e2d8893424e38383245d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/commits/5c54b2d8de3a9356966e3a1663f87a681dd94272","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/