d returned the old (calendar-less) scope set.\n\nSwitch to setPrompt(''consent'') so (re)connecting always re-consents and\ngrants the Calendar scope (and refreshes the offline refresh token).\nExisting users need one reconnect to pick up the scope.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015zMZvSJ4BK7ZQu5E6pTXvJ","tree":{"sha":"c0cd116e0e2f1dcdde56cdc9ef93e171f7779367","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/c0cd116e0e2f1dcdde56cdc9ef93e171f7779367"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/commits/46c7be88e11ed8abbe266003c0054e16862f06f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commit/46c7be88e11ed8abbe266003c0054e16862f06f8","node_id":"C_kwDOFJBLONoAKDQ2YzdiZTg4ZTExZWQ4YWJiZTI2NjAwM2MwMDU0ZTE2