guerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/44b6efe03c06868a12ffc6bb44afc16dd83a0451/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T02:12:39Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T02:12:39Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"message":"feat(mobile): Maple-style flat task list + hide FAB on list pages\n\nChores on mobile: replace the per-person lanes with one flat, filterable\nlist (desktop/kiosk keep the lanes). Filters on top — a status/date\nsegment (Pending / Overdue / Completed / All) and a person selector —\nplus the same card style and a fixed bottom ''add item'' bar above the tab\nbar. Counts on each chip reflect the current person scope.\n\nAppLayout: hide the floating capture FAB on /shopping and /housing/chores\n(reactive to Inertia navigation) since those pages have their own inline\nadd input, so the FAB no longer duplicates the action or covers content.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015zMZvSJ4BK7ZQu5E6pTXvJ","tree":{"sha":"d6925937f2817f525333691b893d559b190035e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/d6925937f2817f525333691b893d559b190035e1"