l() (2 calls; lazy is\n  removed in v3). No other v3-affected APIs in app code: axios is self-imported,\n  no router.on(''invalid''/''exception''), no router.cancel(), lodash-es import is\n  commented out, the single <Head> needs no change.\n\nCross-repo (local, non-shared): atmosphere-core ''inertia-v2-compat'' branch\nconstraint extended to ^1.0 || ^2.0 || ^3.0; atmosphere-ui peer extended to\ninclude ^3 (bump to 1.4.5, needs publish). dev-main of both untouched.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015zMZvSJ4BK7ZQu5E6pTXvJ","tree":{"sha":"4d12c176d926f7440c9a016445ca9e43eeac2c41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/4d12c176d926f7440c9a016445ca9e43eeac2c41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/commits/cfa37c4dda275129a36965e86f0e164e425efaa9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commit/cfa37c4dda275129a36965e86f0e164e425efaa9","node_id":"C_kwDOFJBLONoAKGNmYTM3YzRkZGEyNzUxMjlhMzY5NjVlODZmMGUxNjRlNDI1ZWZhYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commit/d4fe0ffd7c9c6fb29f9905ea881d71c7c527ad06","sha":"d4fe0ffd7c9c6fb29f9905ea881d71c7c527ad06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/d4fe0ffd7c9c6fb29f9905ea881d71c7c527ad06"}],"sha":"cfa37c4dda275129a36965e86f0e164e425efaa9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/cfa37c4dda275129a36965e86f0e164e425efaa9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/d4fe0ffd7c9c6fb29f9905ea881d71c7c527ad06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T17:45:34Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T17:45:34Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"message":"fix(inertia-v2): drop dead ''data'' field from bulk-delete useForm (v2 conflict)\n\nInertia v2 warns that a useForm field named ''data'' collides with the form''s own\ndata property/method. The three bulk-delete forms (Inbox, Dashboard, Finance)\ndeclared { data: [] } but never read it — each builds its payload via\n.transform(() => ({ data: <local ids> })), so the field was dead. Removed it;\nthe posted payload ({ data: [...] }) and the /finance/transactions/bulk/delete\nbackend are unchanged. Clears the v2 console error and unshadows form.data.\n\nAlso audited all ~84 router.reload() calls: none chain .then()/await, so v2''s\nnow-async partial reloads need no changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015zMZvSJ4BK7ZQu5E6pTXvJ","tree":{"sha":"29cccc9635722f6287e29edef0e28e2bc2d9538a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/29cccc9635722f6287e29edef0e28e2bc2d9538a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/commits/d4fe0ffd7c9c6fb29f9905ea881d71c7c527ad06","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_e