thor":{"date":"2026-08-16T16:44:42Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T16:44:42Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"message":"chore(inertia): consume atmosphere via VCS repo on inertia-v2-compat branch\n\nSwitches loger off the private copy to a Composer VCS repository pointing at the\nlocal atmosphere-core, pinned to the new ''inertia-v2-compat'' branch (dev-...).\nThat branch is main HEAD + only the widened inertia constraint (^1.0 || ^2.0);\ndev-main is untouched, so neatrents/academic (which track dev-main) are safe.\n\nA VCS repo reads the committed branch, not the working tree, so atmosphere-core\ncan stay on main with its WIP while loger builds against the compat branch.\n\nDurable: push ''inertia-v2-compat'' to the atmosphere-core remote (safe — it does\nnot touch main). The gitignored packages/ copy is now unused.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015zMZvSJ4BK7ZQu5E6pTXvJ","tree":{"sha":"463e39fc41e8d398681420a2bcdbb9b88284fb98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/463e39fc41e8d398681420a2bcdbb9b88284fb98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/commits/3ac98de80b871f5db9e652b4642b1122fae1870b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE