ed{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/a60c42723cd4eb906e0046109cbe8cae8aafb32d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T16:39:28Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T16:39:28Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"message":"chore(inertia): use a loger-private atmosphere copy (don''t touch shared dev-main)\n\nneatrents & academic consume freesgen/atmosphere@dev-main from Packagist, so the\nshared package must stay pristine. Instead of widening atmosphere-core''s main,\nloger points its Composer path repository at a PRIVATE copy vendored under\npackages/ (gitignored), whose composer.json is the only place the inertia\nconstraint is relaxed to ^1.0 || ^2.0. atmosphere-core is left byte-identical to\nHEAD; the other prod apps are completely unaffected.\n\nDurable option for later: cut a dedicated v2-compat release of atmosphere\n(a branch/tag other apps don''t track) rather than a per-project copy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015zMZvSJ4BK7ZQu5E6pTXvJ","tree":{"sha":"b21f8c4865a608d7ca58fae8b05c82f36fe56b11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/b21f8c4865a608d7ca58fae8b05c82f36fe56b11"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/commits/a60c42723cd4eb906e0046109cbe8cae8aafb32d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesu