NzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/8ada72b394d3264d6d9e67791c3cf536da5709bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T16:34:30Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T16:34:30Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"message":"chore(inertia): local unblock — path-repo freesgen/atmosphere for v2\n\ncomposer update failed because freesgen/atmosphere (dev-main, from Packagist)\nhard-requires inertia-laravel ^1.0. atmosphere is our own package and its PHP\nuses no v2-breaking APIs (no Inertia::lazy/defer/merge), so it only needs the\nconstraint widened.\n\nPoints a Composer path repository at the local atmosphere-core git checkout\n(../atmosphere-core, github jesusantguerrero/atmosphere-core, branch main =>\ndev-main) whose composer.json constraint is widened to ''^1.0 || ^2.0''. Path\nrepos take priority over Packagist, so this resolves v2 locally without\npublishing. Durable fix: push that same one-line constraint change to\natmosphere-core main.\n\nnpm side: atmosphere-ui only peer-depends inertia ^1 and uses it solely in\nStorybook stories (not shipped components), so install with --legacy-peer-deps.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015zMZvSJ4BK7ZQu5E6pTXvJ","tree":{"sha":"29fec447166e11d044a7ced0d876927eae7f3305","url":"https://api.github.c