hor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/183d409f6a0cf86955cc91293d9d2e621a5c24c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T16:23:00Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T16:23:00Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"message":"chore(inertia): prep v1 -> v2 (bumps + v1-safe code fixes)\n\nDeclares the Inertia v2 upgrade and applies the code changes that are safe\nunder BOTH v1 and v2, so this branch runs fine before the packages are even\ninstalled. The actual install (composer/npm) runs on the dev machine.\n\n- package.json:  @inertiajs/vue3        ^1.3.0 -> ^2.0.0\n- composer.json: inertiajs/inertia-laravel ^1.0 -> ^2.0\n- BoardForm.vue / BoardSide.vue: import from the ancient ''@inertiajs/inertia-vue3''\n  (a v0-era package) -> ''@inertiajs/vue3''. This was already wrong on v1 and would\n  hard-break on v2.\n- Meals/ShoppingList.vue: router.replace(url) -> router.visit(url, {replace:true,\n  preserveState:true}). v2 repurposes router.replace() for client-side visits, so\n  the old call would change behavior; router.visit(...,{replace:true}) is\n  equivalent on both v1 and v2.\n\nRequirements already met (Laravel 11, PHP 8.2, Vue 3.5) — no framework work.\nFollow-up after install: spot-check the ~84 router.reload() calls, now that\npartial reloads are async in v2.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015zMZvSJ4BK7ZQu5E6pTXvJ","tree":{"sha":"8b249e52f275b78e7bd7cab3d429b9cc00f140aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/8b249e52f275b78e7bd7cab3d429b9cc00f140aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/commits/183d409f6a0cf86955cc91293d9d2e621a5c24c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commit/183d409f6a0cf86955cc91293d9d2e621a5c24c9","node_id":"C_kwDOFJBLONoAKDE4M2Q0MDlmNmEwY2Y4Njk1NWNjOTEyOTNkOWQyZTYyMWE1YzI0Yzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commit/76576145819872bf88efa9b842475e10d6ef495b","sha":"76576145819872bf88efa9b842475e10d6ef495b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/76576145819872bf88efa9b842475e10d6ef495b"}],"sha":"183d409f6a0cf86955cc91293d9d2e621a5c24c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/183d409f6a0cf86955cc91293d9d2e621a5c24c9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/76576145819872bf88efa9b842475e10d6ef495b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T15:59:14Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T15:59:14Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"message":"feat(nav): mobile tabs deep-link to each section''s action surface\n\nThe 5 hubs previously all landed on their module overview. For a daily-use\napp that is an extra tap to the thing you actually use, so three tabs now\nopen the action surface directly:\n  Comida  -> /meal-planner   (was /meals/overview)\n  Tareas  -> /housing/chores (was /housing)\n  Dinero  -> /budgets        (was /finance)\n\nTo avoid the highlight breaking when you navigate WITHIN a section (e.g.\n/budgets -> /finance/transactions, or /housing/chores -> /housing/occurrence),\neach tab gains an `activeMatch` RegExp that decides the highlight independently\nof its deep-link target. MobileMenuItem now honors item.activeMatch when\npresent, falling back to prefix matching otherwise. Patterns mirror the desktop\nsidebar''s isActiveFunction so mobile and desktop light up consistently:\n  Hoy    /^\\/(today|dashboard)/   (fixes Hoy never lighting, since /today\n                                    redirects to /dashboard)\n  Agenda /^\\/calendar/\n  Comida /(meal-planner|meals|ingredients)/\n  Tareas /(housing|loger-profiles)/\n  Dinero /(finance|budgets)/       (covers all /finance/* plus /budgets)\n\nEach section page keeps its own sub-nav (Overview/Budget/Planner...), so\nlanding deep never strands the user.\n\nVerified live in a 390px mobile viewport: Dinero lands on /budgets and stays\nlit; Tareas stays lit on /housing/occurrence.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015zMZvSJ4BK7ZQu5E6pTXvJ","tree":{"sha":"f284eb54d6f246b04f6930e8302338fea520719a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/f284eb54d6f246b04f6930e8302338fea520719a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/commits/76576145819872bf88efa9b842475e10d6ef495b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commit/76576145819872bf88efa9b842475e10d6ef495b","node_id":"C_kwDOFJBLONoAKDc2NTc2MTQ1ODE5ODcyYmY4OGVmYTliODQyNDc1ZTEwZDZlZjQ5NWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commit/0f4da825bac00a2fe4b3a63f971716c1ba9f0cb1","sha":"0f4da825bac00a2fe4b3a63f971716c1ba9f0cb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/0f4da825bac00a2fe4b3a63f971716c1ba9f0cb1"}],"sha":"76576145819872bf88efa9b842475e10d6ef495b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/76576145819872bf88efa9b842475e10d6ef495b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/commits/0f4da825bac00a2fe4b3a63f971716c1ba9f0cb1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T15:01:25Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T15:01:25Z","email":"jesusant.guerrero@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Guerrero"},"message":"feat(nav): v3 mobile navbar — 5 fixed hubs + floating capture FAB\n\nReworks the mobile bottom nav from ''4 tabs + centered FAB'' to the agreed\n5-hub structure with a floating cross-domain capture button.\n\nBar (fixed, always the same 5 pillars regardless of module enablement):\n  Hoy (/today) · Agenda (/calendar) · Comida (/meals/overview) ·\n  Tareas (/housing) · Dinero (/finance). Voz cálida en los labels\n  (Money=Dinero, Agenda, Tasks=Tareas added to es.json).\n\nCapture ''+'' (MobileQuickCapture.vue): floats offset-right ABOVE the bar\n(Maple-style) so it never covers the 5th tab. Tapping opens a sheet with\n6 actions in fixed order — Gasto · Ingreso · Transferencia · Tarea ·\nEvento · Comida. The three money actions open the app-wide TransactionModal\n(WITHDRAW/DEPOSIT/transfer); Tarea/Evento/Comida deep-link to their creation\nsurface (/housing/chores, /calendar, /meal-planner) until a global modal\nexists for them.\n\n- useAppMenu: mobileMenu is now a fixed 5-item list; FAB no longer injected\n  into the bar array.\n- AppLayout mounts <MobileQuickCapture/> next to the bar (lg:hidden).\n\nVerified live: 5 tabs render with warm labels + correct routes; FAB floats\nright above the bar; sheet opens with the 6 colored actions; Gasto opens the\ntransaction modal. Desktop sidebar unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015zMZvSJ4BK7ZQu5E6pTXvJ","tree":{"sha":"6bf6081031ebb1c4b19fce55cffdc807c992051d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/trees/6bf6081031ebb1c4b19fce55cffdc807c992051d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jesusantguerrero/atmosphere/git/commits/0f4da825bac00a2fe4b3a63f971716c1ba9f0cb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17421742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesusantguerrero","id":17421742,"login":"jesusantguerrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDIxNzQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesusantguerrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/u