hlY2ZmOTIwNDI5OTJkNGQyMTFlMDg2OGNiMWExOWNkOThiY2U0Mjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/EOEPCA/rm-workspace-api/commit/6a0fbfafa1bda219b5e8ef845474896ce3528d75","sha":"6a0fbfafa1bda219b5e8ef845474896ce3528d75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EOEPCA/rm-workspace-api/commits/6a0fbfafa1bda219b5e8ef845474896ce3528d75"}],"sha":"8ecff92042992d4d211e0868cb1a19cd98bce427","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EOEPCA/rm-workspace-api/commits/8ecff92042992d4d211e0868cb1a19cd98bce427"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54577319?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/achtsnits/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/achtsnits/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/achtsnits/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/achtsnits/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/achtsnits","id":54577319,"login":"achtsnits","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0NTc3MzE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/achtsnits/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/achtsnits/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/achtsnits/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/achtsnits/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/achtsnits/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/achtsnits","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EOEPCA/rm-workspace-api/commits/6a0fbfafa1bda219b5e8ef845474896ce3528d75/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-03T13:52:04Z","email":"54577319+achtsnits@users.noreply.github.com","name":"achtsnits"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-03T13:52:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fully adapt for upcoming v2 release, add UI to manage members, buckets and access (#26)\n\n* Add additional ignores to .gitignore\n\n* Changed color of logo.svg to white for better visibility\n\n* removed unnecessary directory mount for UI_SOURCE_DIR, renamed frontend prefix to /ui\n\n* refactor: separate Luigi shell and Vue app into distinct directories\n\nThis separation clarifies the roles of Luigi (container shell) and Vue (SPA microfrontend),\nand avoids confusion around multiple HTML entry points.\n\n* Add basis frontendUrl to allow simpler switching to dev server\n\n* Add env variable UI_MODE to set UI mode\n\n* added default values for environment variables, added env var for frontend URL\n\n* Added .gitattributes to ensure consistent line endings\n\n* Move Favicon and Logo to Luigi directory\n\n* fix(workspace-api): align WorkspaceEdit definition with UI component usage\nfix(workspace-api): use correct patch content type for Workspace CRD\n\n* extended README\n\n* Based Vue-app on Quasar.js\n\n* Removed sample code\n\n* Created composable useLuigi for Luigi integration\nRefactored provided context for ManagementPage\n\n* remove dist folder\n\n* add .gitkeep to dist\n\n* update .gitignoe\n\n* refactor: restructuring, update of python tooling for uv and pre-commit\n\n* chore: update readme\n\n* chore: update readme\n\n* chore: update readme\n\n* chore: restructure, use docker multistage build\n\n* chore: update github action\n\n* chore: fix github action\n\n* feat: endpoints, memberships, grants exposed through api\n\n* feat: aligning UI with api changes, adding version for workspace, ...\n\n* feat: endpoint for BucketAccessRequests\n\n* feat: extra & linked buckets in mangement ui\n\n* chore: correct description of Frontend setup in readme\n\n* fix(workspace-api): mount workspace_ui/public if running with frontend dev server\n\n* feat: introduce owner/contributor role and add further validation, only consider extra buckets for sharing\n\n* fix: disable url validation\n\n* feat: Separate Luigi shell and Quasar frontend app, consolidate build in workspace_ui/dist\n\n* chore: match bash & rsync versions with node alpine image\n\n* feat: use tabs for members and buckets\n\n* feat: extend injected data\n\n* feat: wip: Bucket Management\n\n* feat: Refactor member table\n\n* feat: Show own linked buckets and available buckets\n\n* feat: Show bucket requests\n\n* feat: improvements for tab buckets\n\n* chore: fixed type in readme\n\n* chore: remove unused code\n\n* refactor: Extract tab contents of management page into separate files\n\n* chore: serve Luigi shell with dummy data from it''s own simple http server\n\n* feat: switch from overall saving to backend to separate save requests per item (member, extra bucket, linked bucket, buckt grants)\n\n* feat: submit grant/deny/revoke from UI to server\n\n* feat: merge API changes, reflect in UI\n\n* fix: improve permission handling, add test scenarios\n\n* feat: simplify logic around buckets, no need for separate \"bucket\" and \"extra_buckets\" fields, just consolidate in \"buckets\", discoverable is purely internally handled within the bucket access requests\n\n* feat: one nested level deeper for workspace (to keep client compatibility expecting workspace.storage.credentials), also changed from pending back to provisioning als checked by other clients\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Martin <mroesel@roesel.at>","tree":{"sha":"9e6f28821284c4008d2b421c35575e66e3b200a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EOEPCA/rm-workspace-api/git/trees/9e6f28821284c4008d2b421c35575e66e3b200a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EOEPCA/rm-workspace-api/git/commits/6a0fbfafa1bda219b5e8ef845474896ce3528d75","verification":{"payload":"tree 9e6f28821284c4008d2b421c35575e66e3b200a2\nparent 9af9fb3d90812132379a9d4a48f1e59d534b793a\nauthor achtsnits <54577319+achtsnits@users.noreply.github.com> 1759499524 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1759499524 +0200\n\nfully adapt for upcoming v2 release, add UI to manage members, buckets and access (#26)\n\n* Add additional ignores to .gitignore\n\n* Changed color of logo.svg to white for better visibility\n\n* removed unnecessary directory mount for UI_SOURCE_DIR, renamed frontend prefix to /ui\n\n* refactor: separate Luigi shell and Vue app into distinct directories\n\nThis separation clarifies the roles of Luigi (container shell) and Vue (SPA microfrontend),\nand avoids confusion around multiple HTML entry points.\n\n* Add basis frontendUrl to allow simpler switching to dev server\n\n* Add env variable UI_MODE to set UI mode\n\n* added default values for environment variables, added env var for frontend URL\n\n* Added .gitattributes to ensure consistent line endings\n\n* Move Favicon and Logo to Luigi directory\n\n* fix(workspace-api): align WorkspaceEdit definition with UI component usage\nfix(workspace-api): use correct patch content type for Workspace CRD\n\n* extended README\n\n* Based Vue-app on Quasar.js\n\n* Removed sample code\n\n* Created composable useLuigi for Luigi integration\nRefactored provided context for ManagementPage\n\n* remove dist folder\n\n* add .gitkeep to dist\n\n* update .gitignoe\n\n* refactor: restructuring, update of python tooling for uv and pre-commit\n\n* chore: update readme\n\n* chore: update readme\n\n* chore: update readme\n\n* chore: restructure, use docker multistage build\n\n* chore: update github action\n\n* chore: fix github action\n\n* feat: endpoints, memberships, grants exposed through api\n\n* feat: aligning UI with api changes, adding version for workspace, ...\n\n* feat: endpoint for BucketAccessRequests\n\n* feat: extra & linked buckets in mangement ui\n\n* chore: correct description of Frontend setup in readme\n\n* fix(workspace-api): mount workspace_ui/public if running with frontend dev server\n\n* feat: introduce owner/contributor role and add further validation, only consider extra buckets for sharing\n\n* fix: disable url validation\n\n* feat: Separate Luigi shell and Quasar frontend app, consolidate build in workspace_ui/dist\n\n* chore: match bash & rsync versions with node alpine image\n\n* feat: use tabs for members and buckets\n\n* feat: extend injected data\n\n* feat: wip: Bucket Management\n\n* feat: Refactor member table\n\n* feat: Show own linked buckets and available buckets\n\n* feat: Show bucket requests\n\n* feat: improvements for tab buckets\n\n* chore: fixed type in readme\n\n* chore: remove unused code\n\n* refactor: Extract tab contents of management page into separate files\n\n* chore: serve Luigi shell with dummy data from it''s own simple http server\n\n* feat: switch from overall saving to backend to separate save requests per item (member, extra bucket, linked bucket, buckt grants)\n\n* feat: submit grant/deny/revoke from UI to server\n\n* feat: merge API changes, reflect in UI\n\n* fix: improve permission handling, add test scenarios\n\n* feat: simplify logic around buckets, no need for separate \"bucket\" and \"extra_buckets\" fields, just consolidate in \"buckets\", discoverable is purely internally handled within the bucket access requests\n\n* feat: one nested level deeper for workspace (to keep client compatibility expecting workspace.storage.credentials), also changed from pending back to provisioning als checked by other clients\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Martin <mroesel@roesel.at>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJo39UECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMqQQAJFG3jiEjqzdlV2tXa8eQFtG\n0DQ5Q38DKK2sEeHxWiMsmVDFK3VIkRhM6SWx62h701QSAL8kyK5oV6AEXa+uahRG\nYobxhf0yrdNDGUgUQ9g+W6moOnvgIu78p2WlpQ/qZ+/EKhwLhxgg9fxoVN1INRm3\n/2mBzR6OcnIUVo23fXU7QCc21CICsTuy10GyRf8prcegzDV4hL20dU3xq8FLcWyw\nTy+f7XgMr16il0FE7EQRftOmptGHeLp5JAdtGd1eaRvRIF1dUDCSr8yRqD+3CkAn\nFpXjzRZ9TYNuOKIB6atureWi0WNxKJBGVjVBs7Gi3Yo2BDSAgmvjK7qEdC9lH08A\nordB5s7crtCSINcKw3EscjiHysrki8SkaI7B3Duo6MP+QfjDNFCgjaSGTYg/czFz\nPl3KdXRtyZwnKvWi8QZo61PZhoDuBRS+PzVLozTn+BTosLZEEOEz5bny/rNNOKEx\nDN9cCzZPL4WNaVNj4nmIyFNUnahnTMHDGCgBRcD+v5RIIoUygtzJl1BlI/t2vVMX\nnyDEIIfstUTwpruFu341ygVLBL94lYlo7ZJa/kH8ccZSUDYCW2GbGMNfGgnhOikA\nZoNhCTVrgGDgdvWJVaVYDeH3pjL4Uknvl2+GMVM9q3VtzIfsH8oBtMB7xEZuKyKs\n7/+