 a hand-computed\nexpectation, plus a test that an invalid number blocks Save with a\nvalidation message.","tree":{"sha":"8049214951c34bc782019f78cb541aff34330170","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/git/trees/8049214951c34bc782019f78cb541aff34330170"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/git/commits/ee287c8faf625c340398ddeacb550560312204af","verification":{"payload":"tree 8049214951c34bc782019f78cb541aff34330170\nparent 5eac8a45c46f018758ee7133d9fd4756d34c2843\nauthor Jeevan Mahesha <34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com> 1790529327 +0530\ncommitter Jeevan Mahesha <34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com> 1790529327 +0530\n\ntest: cover the remaining mobile number formats and invalid rejection\n\nmobile-number.util.ts documents 4 accepted input shapes; only the\nbare-10-digit case had coverage. Add the other 3 (leading 0, 91\nprefix, +91 prefix) as individually-reportable tests, each checked\nagainst toCanonicalMobileNumber() rather than a hand-computed\nexpectation, plus a test that an invalid number blocks Save with a\nvalidation message.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgM2YO4dLP2/NZtPfHD3yrAusqcJ\nXiHHSwx3jECLouLB8AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQINKkpQPh9PHlTnckJzyUyFytKU+B/Gtp6j2syJXGGHVcu8bDI1sR+RapbmR0qrL1b\ncr/XkvOKLed516tOdYJgs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T13:43:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34814862?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeevanMahesha","id":34814862,"login":"Jeeva