,"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T16:52:45Z","email":"34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeevan Mahesha"},"message":"test: cover the profile comments feature\n\nAdd/delete had zero e2e coverage. Cover the add-then-delete round\ntrip (reopening the drawer between saves to prove each change actually\npersisted to Firestore, not just form state), plus the documented\n\"flush on save\" behavior where a typed-but-not-added comment is still\nsaved.","tree":{"sha":"12c0ea6900b71f55114071c485b2e99f49ca4ab0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/git/trees/12c0ea6900b71f55114071c485b2e99f49ca4ab0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/git/commits/00f40f3e194cc847e0df5c649d16d1334c5746bb","verification":{"payload":"tree 12c0ea6900b71f55114071c485b2e99f49ca4ab0\nparent d4995ff563e39e5b1151c91865e41229f624abbf\nauthor Jeevan Mahesha <34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com> 1790527965 +0530\ncommitter Jeevan Mahesha <34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com> 1790527965 +0530\n\ntest: cover the profile comments feature\n\nAdd/delete had zero e2e coverage. Cover the add-then-delete round\ntrip (reopening the drawer between saves to prove each change actually\npersisted to Firestore, not just form state), plus the documented\n\"flush on save\" behavior where a typed-but-not-added comment is still\nsaved.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgM2YO4dLP2/NZtPfHD3yrAusqcJ\nXiHHSwx3jECLouLB8AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQDPRyD1XMGA4yVTQLV7AZk6ZZyjN3qYsYdZSoGL/MGoTZX4rR1d0iYMsMgO5SRM5hx\nDp6qjIVOe8uBhQ9BZ8pQ4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T13:43:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34814862?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.gith