the installed Google Chrome when Playwright''s Chromium is missing\n\nPlaywright''s browser CDN is unreachable on some networks, so its Chromium\nbuild may never get installed. playwright.config.ts now checks for the\nbundled executable and uses the chrome channel when it is absent.\nPLAYWRIGHT_BROWSER_CHANNEL still forces a channel explicitly.","tree":{"sha":"5d090d87a0d27152fc97e1207e7e81ad15675792","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/git/trees/5d090d87a0d27152fc97e1207e7e81ad15675792"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/git/commits/b6d47a10d92f0984b8128d96e58c4fa4b3962751","verification":{"payload":"tree 5d090d87a0d27152fc97e1207e7e81ad15675792\nparent b699cff243d8e0ca45c33c08a7c57633cba63ecc\nauthor Jeevan Mahesha <34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com> 1790267818 +0530\ncommitter Jeevan Mahesha <34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com> 1790267818 +0530\n\ntest: fall back to the installed Google Chrome when Playwright''s Chromium is missing\n\nPlaywright''s browser CDN is unreachable on some networks, so its Chromium\nbuild may never get installed. playwright.config.ts now checks for the\nbundled executable and uses the chrome channel when it is absent.\nPLAYWRIGHT_BROWSER_CHANNEL still forces a channel explicitly.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgM2YO4dLP2/NZtPfHD3yrAusqcJ\nXiHHSwx3jECLouLB8AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQJMQfb8sPzYByfHZZ5gODb/bZq3RC2Me+1GUPkTMP8TNZkG64Mn0vaL+g9CAaAuWR7\nZtw+yvyR+01jVEl7dffwA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-24T16:57:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34814862?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/follo