hesha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeevanMahesha","id":34814862,"login":"JeevanMahesha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODE0ODYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/commits/7e75a7fe00cda869f125d3973190b5a15c109d0a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T16:26:58Z","email":"34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeevan Mahesha"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T16:26:58Z","email":"34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeevan Mahesha"},"message":"test: add emulator-backed Playwright e2e suite via ng e2e\n\n- provideFirebase gains a useEmulators option that connects Auth and\n  Firestore to the local emulators and refuses any non demo- project id\n- committed environment.e2e.ts (demo-profilemanager, no secrets) swapped in\n  by new e2e build/serve configurations; dev server pinned to 127.0.0.1:4300\n- ng e2e via playwright-ng-schematics, devServerTarget locked to serve:e2e\n- playwright.config.ts starts the emulators as webServer with graceful\n  SIGTERM shutdown; global setup waits for both emulators and seeds an admin\n  user with the admin custom claim over the emulator REST API\n- browser specs: auth redirect/login, create, edit, delete (confirm and\n  cancel), pagination, status filter; rules project covers firestore.rules\n  with @firebase/rules-unit-testing\n- data-testid hooks on table rows, mobile cards and the total footer\n- README and CLAUDE.md document the setup, Java prerequisite and the\n  PLAYWRIGHT_BROWSER_CHANNEL=chrome fallback","tree":{"sha":"20fe20dfae94038755775a0986414efe57747d67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/git/trees/20fe20dfae94038755775a0986414efe57747d67"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/git/commits/7e75a7fe00cda869f125d3973190b5a15c109d0a","verification":{"payload":"tree 20fe20dfae94038755775a0986414efe57747d67\nparent 5ccb3171690ef1b2b7f7805060efda40c32ae7a6\nauthor Jeevan Mahesha <34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com> 1790267218 +0530\ncommitter Jeevan Mahesha <34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com> 1790267218 +0530\n\ntest: add emulator-backed Playwright e2e suite via ng e2e\n\n- provideFirebase gains a useEmulators option that connects Auth and\n  Firestore to the local emulators and refuses any non demo- project id\n- committed environment.e2e.ts (demo-profilemanager, no secrets) swapped in\n  by new e2e build/serve configurations; dev server pinned to 127.0.0.1:4300\n- ng e2e via playwright-ng-schematics, devServerTarget locked to serve:e2e\n- playwright.config.ts starts the emulators as webServer with graceful\n  SIGTERM shutdown; global setup waits for both emulators and seeds an admin\n  user with the admin custom claim over the emulator REST API\n- browser specs: auth redirect/login, create, edit, delete (confirm and\n  cancel), pagination, status filter; rules project covers firestore.rules\n  with @firebase/rules-unit-testing\n- data-testid hooks on table rows, mobile cards and the total footer\n- README and CLAUDE.md document the setup, Java prerequisite and the\n  PLAYWRIGHT_BROWSER_CHANNEL=chrome fallback\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-