0ef1b2b7f7805060efda40c32ae7a6","verification":{"payload":"tree d6974783807ecbae0166b512c396e418ee3397a0\nparent 0c3cbee25a075982dbbde59ee6d961bee9a09c88\nauthor Jeevan Mahesha <34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com> 1790267206 +0530\ncommitter Jeevan Mahesha <34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com> 1790267206 +0530\n\nfix: recompute the profile total and pagination cursors after create, update and delete\n\nThe resource loader only recounted when the filter key changed, so a plain\nreload() after a mutation left the footer total and pager stale. Route all\npost-mutation reloads through refreshProfiles(), which invalidates the key.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgM2YO4dLP2/NZtPfHD3yrAusqcJ\nXiHHSwx3jECLouLB8AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQFil8FDnJNysYeq0xNbYj+n3fuZJKDzZagvFNnQnjEy4gecb9kk4bF6dL0Cjv75SOS\nV6aNUbJC4paxPDu2F+1Qg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-24T16:57:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34814862?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeevanMahesha","id":34814862,"login":"JeevanMahesha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODE0ODYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/commit/5ccb3171690ef1b2b7f7805060efda40c32ae7a6","node_id":"C_kwDOFKNBBtoAKDVjY2IzMTcxNjkwZWYxYjJiN2Y3ODA1MDYwZWZkYTQwYzMyYWU3YTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/commit/0c3cbee25a075982dbbde59ee6d961bee9a09c88","sha":"0c3cbee25a075982dbbde59ee6d961bee9a09c88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/commits/0c3cbee25a075982dbbde59ee6d961bee9a09c88"}],"sha":"5ccb3171690ef1b2b7f7805060efda40c32ae7a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/commits/5ccb3171690ef1b2b7f7805060efda40c32ae7a6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34814862?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeevanMahesha","id":34814862,"login":"JeevanMahesha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODE0ODYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/commits/0c3cbee25a075982dbbde59ee6d961bee9a09c88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T11:13:19Z","email":"34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeevan Mahesha"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T11:13:19Z","email":"34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeevan Mahesha"},"message":"fix: reset the profile form when the drawer closes or opens in create mode\n\nValues typed into \"Add Profile\" survived closing and reopening the drawer.\nThe only reset lived in the effect watching the profile resource, which is\nidle in create mode (no id) and therefore never fired.\n\nA dedicated effect now watches the drawer state and, on close or on opening\nin create mode, resets the form to the blank profile, clears touched/dirty\nstate and the unsent comment draft.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2f139f3ec4e97d51fb00920406d54144723154d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/git/trees/2f139f3ec4e97d51fb00920406d54144723154d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/git/commits/0c3cbee25a075982dbbde59ee6d961bee9a09c88","verification":{"payload":"tree 2f139f3ec4e97d51fb00920406d54144723154d3\nparent c8523abf4d7e89284704e70c7f7f347b0c57d8f1\nauthor Jeevan Mahesha <34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com> 1790248399 +0530\ncommitter Jeevan Mahesha <34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com> 1790248399 +0530\n\nfix: reset the profile form when the drawer closes or opens in create mode\n\nValues typed into \"Add Profile\" survived closing and reopening the drawer.\nThe only reset lived in the effect watching the profile resource, which is\nidle in create mode (no id) and therefore never fired.\n\nA dedicated effect now watches the drawer state and, on close or on opening\nin create mode, resets the form to the blank profile, clears touched/dirty\nstate and the unsent comment draft.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgM2YO4dLP2/NZtPfHD3yrAusqcJ\nXiHHSwx3jECLouLB8AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAA