4ce5de243c55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/git/commits/c8523abf4d7e89284704e70c7f7f347b0c57d8f1","verification":{"payload":"tree 30bed041a942c47e26dcc82f2c414ce5de243c55\nparent 8596177dfdc0fa77bdfcecd178256726144941c7\nauthor Jeevan Mahesha <34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com> 1790248234 +0530\ncommitter Jeevan Mahesha <34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com> 1790248234 +0530\n\nfeat: show created and last-updated times in the profile drawer header\n\nAdds a muted audit line under the name and status badge in the view/edit\ndrawer: \"Created 21 Sep 2026 · Updated 3 hours ago\". Exact timestamps are\nshown on hover, and the line doubles as the sheet''s accessible description.\n\n- add timeAgo pipe: minutes/hours relative, plain date once a day or older\n- add DISPLAY_DATE_FORMAT / DISPLAY_DATE_TIME_FORMAT so created and updated\n  always share the same format\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgM2YO4dLP2/NZtPfHD3yrAusqcJ\nXiHHSwx3jECLouLB8AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQAV/S7iqV1xiWL3qR3oH7M6v3V4tEQ5uIOCjnCdR0Euf34nMhox7ugCL58vFNXEvs9\nrJn/gLLdFmM+25HRKpJg8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-24T16:57:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34814862?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeevanMahesha","id":34814862,"login":"JeevanMahesha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODE0ODYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://