JeevanMahesha","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/commits/8596177dfdc0fa77bdfcecd178256726144941c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T11:03:48Z","email":"34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeevan Mahesha"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T11:03:48Z","email":"34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeevan Mahesha"},"message":"feat: make star sign optional with a \"Not specified\" placeholder\n\nSome profiles don''t list a star, so the star field no longer blocks saving.\nThe star match score is derived from the star, so it is required only while\na star is selected; otherwise both are stored as null.\n\n- add a \"Not specified\" option to the star dropdown to clear a selection\n- show \"Not specified\" (muted) for empty star / score in the view drawer\n- show \"Not specified\" in the Score column of the desktop and mobile lists\n- introduce NOT_SPECIFIED_LABEL so the wording is defined once\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e97097e7173d6778b37296503a95bd82582bbee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/git/trees/9e97097e7173d6778b37296503a95bd82582bbee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/git/commits/8596177dfdc0fa77bdfcecd178256726144941c7","verification":{"payload":"tree 9e97097e7173d6778b37296503a95bd82582bbee\nparent 3fae7e064fdfe1dd8275acf2282486d009fd7b5a\nauthor Jeevan Mahesha <34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com> 1790247828 +0530\ncommitter Jeevan Mahesha <34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com> 1790247828 +0530\n\nfeat: make star sign optional with a \"Not specified\" placeholder\n\nSome profiles don''t list a star, so the star field no longer blocks saving.\nThe star match score is derived from the star, so it is required only while\na star is selected; otherwise both are stored as null.\n\n- add a \"Not specified\" option to the star dropdown to clear a selection\n- show \"Not specified\" (muted) for empty star / score in the view drawer\n- show \"Not specified\" in the Score column of the desktop and mobile lists\n- introduce NOT_SPECIFIED_LABEL so the wording is defined once\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgM2YO4dLP2/NZtPfHD3yrAusqcJ\nXiHHSwx3jECLouLB8AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQJmGL8YohIfMR43C1TpidL66iOKu/krT/OMQOtkSxoFkxQ5qHtCZfG+5KX24dz9Ykb\nxMpXEneeUvhkNWAGf72gs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-24T16:57:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34814862?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeevanMahesha","id":34814862,"login":"JeevanMahesha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODE0ODYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/commit/8596177dfdc0fa77bdfcecd178256726144941c7","node_id":"C_kwDOFKNBBtoAKDg1OTYxNzdkZmRjMGZhNzdiZGZjZWNkMTc4MjU2NzI2MTQ0OTQxYzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/commit/3fae7e064fdfe1dd8275acf2282486d009fd7b5a","sha":"3fae7e064fdfe1dd8275acf2282486d009fd7b5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/commits/3fae7e064fdfe1dd8275acf2282486d009fd7b5a"}],"sha":"8596177dfdc0fa77bdfcecd178256726144941c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/commits/8596177dfdc0fa77bdfcecd178256726144941c7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34814862?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeevanMahesha","id":34814862,"login":"JeevanMahesha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODE0ODYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/commits/3fae7e064fdfe1dd8275acf2282486d009fd7b5a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:51:04Z","email":"34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeevan Mahesha"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:51:04Z","email":"34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeevan Mahesha"},"message":"feat: accept loosely formatted mobile numbers and save them as +91XXXXXXXXXX\n\nUsers can now type or paste a number with spaces, hyphens, dots, parentheses,\na leading 0, or a 91/+91 prefix. Validation runs on the canonical form and the\nprofile is always saved as \"+91\" followed by 10 digits.\n\n- add mobile-number util with toCanonicalMobileNumber / mobileNumberDigits\n- replace the strict pattern() rule with a validate() rule on the canonical form\n- canonicalize the phone search term so any spelling finds the stored record\n- fix call links that prepended +91 to numbers that already had it\n\nExisting Firestore records were migrated to the canonical form beforehand.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c8952779638e94604f3b52413997f1c30d57318b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/git/trees/c8952779638e94604f3b52413997f1c30d57318b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/git/commits/3fae7e064fdfe1dd8275acf2282486d009fd7b5a","verification":{"payload":"tree c8952779638e94604f3b52413997f1c30d57318b\nparent 9224979df194255a660a5f10b1b6d488aa090ef4\nauthor Jeevan Mahesha <34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com> 1790247064 +0530\ncommitter Jeevan Mahesha <34814862+JeevanMahesha@users.noreply.github.com> 1790247064 +0530\n\nfeat: accept loosely formatted mobile numbers and save them as +91XXXXXXXXXX\n\nUsers can now type or paste a number with spaces, hyphens, dots, parentheses,\na leading 0, or a 91/+91 prefix. Validation runs on the canonical form and the\nprofile is always saved as \"+91\" followed by 10 digits.\n\n- add mobile-number util with toCanonicalMobileNumber / mobileNumberDigits\n- replace the strict pattern() rule with a validate() rule on the canonical form\n- canonicalize the phone search term so any spelling finds the stored record\n- fix call links that prepended +91 to numbers that already had it\n\nExisting Firestore records were migrated to the canonical form beforehand.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWV