totype.valueOf and crashes with\n\"config.args is not iterable\". Renaming the destructured binding sidesteps\nthe collision without suppressing the rule.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgM2YO4dLP2/NZtPfHD3yrAusqcJ\nXiHHSwx3jECLouLB8AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQI9VaE84MEVahPyEioUwWPYSeZ+FsGy7Gnej8xDpPjJsRCRtnHdxiQWM1dEZQ+yh69\nsMwZsiLRyZGkaxMmo/dgY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-13T05:56:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34814862?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeevanMahesha","id":34814862,"login":"JeevanMahesha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODE0ODYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeevanMahesha","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/commit/2bb072f9d7523ce8fc7c706e4dc5a52e7a747e13","node_id":"C_kwDOFKNBBtoAKDJiYjA3MmY5ZDc1MjNjZThmYzdjNzA2ZTRkYzVhNTJlN2E3NDdlMTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/commit/3e147daa09ee8f77ec4ffec244ca34f06e14f15b","sha":"3e147daa09ee8f77ec4ffec244ca34f06e14f15b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeevanMahesha/SandboxForBrains/commits/3e147daa09e