in embedding of ZK views without iframe\n\n- ui-core/embed: mountInline() fetches a server-rendered ZK view, injects its\n  deduplicated head assets, appends the body re-creating scripts and tracks the\n  desktop id announced by the response (dt:''...''); destroy() releases the\n  desktop client- and server-side (zAu._rmDesktop).\n- <dynamia-embed mode=\"inline\"> uses it (light DOM, same-origin only).\n- @dynamia-tools/vue: <DynamiaZkEmbed> wrapper (load/error events, loading/error slots).\n- docs/frontend/INLINE_ZK_EMBED.md; happy-dom devDependency for DOM tests.\n\nNo backend endpoint added: the response <head> is already the bootstrap manifest.\n\nRefs #113\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GXVz2G6v1fqFdQjRSh9XZF","tree":{"sha":"0c09bb8d29b47ba42b7668a141cb9a018650175c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/git/trees/0c09bb8d29b47ba42b7668a141cb9a018650175c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/git/commits/65783ec85b8eaf3504a7a7a1e76fc6eff9d4aee8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5221275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marioserrano09","id":5221275,"login":"marioserrano09","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMjEyNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mar