21275,"login":"marioserrano09","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMjEyNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/commits/ef0633e65a0efd5c02ef77d86c779d6207e6e906/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T14:18:51Z","email":"mario@dynamiasoluciones.com","name":"Mario Serrano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T14:19:05Z","email":"mario@dynamiasoluciones.com","name":"Mario Serrano"},"message":"feat(cli): harden env checks, add tests, non-interactive flags for new\n\n- checkJava(): parse the major version out of the \"version \\\"NN\" pattern\n  instead of an includes(''25'') substring match (false-positive risk on\n  e.g. a JDK reporting 17.0.25).\n- checkNode(): read the minimum version from cli.properties/CliConfig\n  instead of a hardcoded 22, matching engines.node (>=24).\n- fetchSpringBootVersion: add a 4s AbortSignal timeout so a slow/dead\n  start.spring.io doesn''t stall the wizard before the first prompt.\n- Add vitest (matching sdk/ui-core/vue/microfrontend-bridge convention)\n  with unit tests for config.ts parsing, replace.ts (token replacement\n  + Java package renaming), env.ts checks, and the new flag parser.\n- dynamia new: add non-interactive flags (--name, --scaffold,\n  --backend-lang, --group-id, --artifact-id, --version, --description,\n  --frontend, --pm, --yes, --git/--no-git) so the wizard can run\n  unattended for scripting/CI. Any flag left unset still prompts.\n- Remove stray package-lock.json (npm) -- this is a pnpm workspace and\n  the package was already tracked in the root pnpm-lock.yaml.\n\nFixes #95, #96, #97, #98, #99, #100\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UcARdenC1Sk5EVpkzboH9W","tree":{"sha":"ea5038fe81b1a05719ad7e92de21becb5c52a394","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/git/trees/ea5038fe81b1a05719ad7e92de21becb5c52a394"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/git/commits/ef0633e65a0efd5c02ef77d86c779d6207e6e906","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5221275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marioserrano09","id":5221275,"login":"marioserrano09","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMjEyNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dynamiatools/framework/commit/ef0633e65a0efd5c02ef77d86c779d6207e6e906","node_id":"C_kwDOFLpEN9oAKGVmMDYzM2U2NWEwZWZkNWMwMmVmNzdkODZjNzc5ZDYyMDdlNmU5MDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dynamiatools/framework/commit/f72cf43ca43d49f4e93098e85849064b6d3698de","sha":"f72cf43ca43d49f4e93098e85849064b6d3698