,"received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dynamiatools/framework/commit/f72cf43ca43d49f4e93098e85849064b6d3698de","node_id":"C_kwDOFLpEN9oAKGY3MmNmNDNjYTQzZDQ5ZjRlOTMwOThlODU4NDkwNjRiNmQzNjk4ZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dynamiatools/framework/commit/b917fd65b0a337075408c4669afb46d20b2c8f04","sha":"b917fd65b0a337075408c4669afb46d20b2c8f04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/commits/b917fd65b0a337075408c4669afb46d20b2c8f04"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/dynamiatools/framework/commit/1c2346ed94a78890fc4e5644c3d20fa567aada0b","sha":"1c2346ed94a78890fc4e5644c3d20fa567aada0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/commits/1c2346ed94a78890fc4e5644c3d20fa567aada0b"}],"sha":"f72cf43ca43d49f4e93098e85849064b6d3698de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/commits/f72cf43ca43d49f4e93098e85849064b6d3698de"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5221275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marioserrano09","id":5221275,"login":"marioserrano09","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMjEyNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/commits/1c2346ed94a78890fc4e5644c3d20fa567aada0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T12:30:42Z","email":"mario@dynamiasoluciones.com","name":"Mario Serrano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T12:30:42Z","email":"mario@dynamiasoluciones.com","name":"Mario Serrano"},"message":"fix(security): stop leaking FQCN/classpath in navigation and entity metadata\n\nNavigationNode.file was serializing the raw Page path to every authenticated\nclient: internal ZK classpath resources (classpath:/zk/...zul) for normal\npages, and the entity''s fully-qualified Java class name for CrudPage nodes.\nBoth are visible in plain JSON via devtools, giving any authenticated user a\nfree map of internal package structure and resource layout (CWE-200).\n\n- NavigationNode: remove the `file` field entirely (all node types). The live\n  `element` reference stays server-side (@JsonIgnore) for internal resolution.\n- ApplicationMetadataController: resolve a CrudPage''s entity class server-side\n  from its live Page.getPath(), never from client-supplied input. Add\n  GET /entities/by-path?path={virtualPath} so CrudPage resolution no longer\n  needs any entity/class information traveling in the navigation JSON.\n- EntityMetadata: className is now @JsonIgnore (server-side only); the\n  client-facing identifier is `id` (the class''s simple name), used to build\n  endpoint/actionsEndpoint/viewsEndpoint and in /entities/{id}. Also fixes a\n  preexisting bug where loadEnpoint() silently overwrote the endpoint with a\n  broken \"/entity/\" (singular) path.\n- ApplicationMetadataLoader: fail fast at metadata-load time if two entities\n  resolve to the same simple name id, naming the colliding classes.\n- ActionMetadata.applicableClasses: FQCN -> simple name, required to keep\n  matching the new /entities/{id} contract (SDK action dispatch depends on it).\n\nSDK/ui-core updated for the breaking contract change (no dual-format fallback,\nper decision with Mario):\n- sdk: NavigationNode.file and EntityMetadata.className removed from types;\n  MetadataApi/ActionsApi entity methods documented as taking the entity id,\n  not a class name; added MetadataApi.getEntityByPath.\n- ui-core CrudPageResolver.resolve(): was the only real consumer of\n  NavigationNode.file — now resolves via internalPath + getEntityByPath\n  instead. One extra sequential round-trip vs. the previous parallel fetch;\n  acceptable tradeoff, noted for later if it matters.\n- ui-core Viewer.ts/CrudView.ts: fixed two real usages of the now-removed\n  EntityMetadata.className (simple-name matching against beanClass FQCN where\n  still needed; beanClass itself keeps coming from ViewDescriptor, untouched).\n- ui-core test fixture/assertion updated to the new id-based dataType.\n\nOut of scope, left untouched: EntityReference.className, ViewDescriptor.\nbeanClass/ViewField.fieldClass (still FQCN, separate mechanisms), and\n/crud-service/{className} (separate controller, FQCN by design).\n\nVerified: mvn compile+test on core/navigation and app (-am); pnpm build+test\non sdk, ui-core, vue — all green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UcARdenC1Sk5EVpkzboH9W","tree":{"sha":"71f0c2afacdc152167a8d27bf042dda501063c34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/git/trees/71f0c2afacdc152167a8d27bf042dda501063c34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/git/commits/1c2346ed94a78890fc4e5644c3d20fa567aada0b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avata