3bab86c3478"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5221275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marioserrano09","id":5221275,"login":"marioserrano09","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMjEyNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/commits/6d115134b10ae611bf82f937f63046081f956055/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T05:48:22Z","email":"mario@dynamiasoluciones.com","name":"Mario Serrano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T05:48:22Z","email":"mario@dynamiasoluciones.com","name":"Mario Serrano"},"message":"docs: resolve #80 (signer key source) and record #83''s fix in the design doc\n\nFlowTokenSigner''s independent secret (dynamia.actions.flow.secret)\nturns out to already match an established repo convention:\nJWTServiceImpl does the exact same thing for JWT_SECRET (same 32-char\nminimum, same warn-and-fall-back-to-an-ephemeral-secret instead of\nfailing startup, extensions/security/.../JWTServiceImpl.java). So this\nisn''t a gap to patch with a new fail-fast mechanism - that would be an\nunprecedented pattern in this codebase, not a bug fix. Documented as\nthe deliberate, permanent answer instead.\n\nAlso updates the doc to reflect #83''s generic CrudState enforcement\n(previously scoped to SaveSupport only).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N3MNM7KKfEtqMjVkwe1dXU","tree":{"sha":"0b4d2dee38394402e8a911b2f2afe334593266d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/git/trees/0b4d2dee38394402e8a911b2f2afe334593266d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/git/commits/6d115134b10ae611bf82f937f63046081f956055","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5221275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marioserrano09","id":5221275,"login":"marioserrano09","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMjEyNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dynamiatools/framework/commit/6d115134b10ae611bf82f937f63046081f956055","node_id":"C_kwDOFLpEN9oAKDZkMTE1MTM0YjEwYWU2MTFiZjgyZjkzN2Y2MzA0NjA4MWY5NTYwNTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dynamiatools/framework/commit/52babb9d7cce29229a8e418a387902cfc0859cff","sha":"52babb9d7cce29229a8e418a387902cfc0859cff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/commits/52babb9d7cce29229a8e418a387902cfc0859cff"}],"sha":"6d115134b10ae611bf82f937f63046081f956055","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/commits/6d115134b10ae611bf82f937f63046081f956055"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5221275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marioserrano09","id":5221275,"login":"marioserrano09","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMjEyNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/commits/52babb9d7cce29229a8e418a387902cfc0859cff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T05:46:28Z","email":"mario@dynamiasoluciones.com","name":"Mario Serrano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T05:46:28Z","email":"mario@dynamiasoluciones.com","name":"Mario Serrano"},"message":"feat(actions): generic CrudState enforcement in ApplicationMetadataController\n\nCloses #83.\n\nApplicationMetadataController.executeAction now rejects a request\nwhose inferred CrudState isn''t in CrudRemoteAction.getApplicableStates()\nbefore execute()/start() ever runs, for any CrudRemoteAction - not just\nSaveRemoteAction/SaveFlowRemoteAction (which already enforced this\nnarrowly via SaveSupport.persist, see d03b14c5).\n\nThe inference mirrors SaveSupport''s own heuristic instead of hitting\nthe database: an entity id present anywhere the client is expected to\ncarry one (dataId, data.id, a non-empty data.ids, or a raw list body)\nmeans \"existing entity\" - allowed when READ/UPDATE/DELETE is declared\napplicable; no id means \"new entity\" - allowed only when CREATE is\ndeclared. This only distinguishes existing-vs-new, not the finer\nREAD/UPDATE/DELETE distinction a specific action may still need to\nenforce itself - see docs/design/SERVER_DRIVEN_ACTION_FLOWS.md §7.6\npoint 2 for the full reasoning and known limits.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N3MNM7KKfEtqMjVkwe1dXU","tree":{"sha":"4abe6bd68683e236d4d132667340dd2d6a0d3e55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/git/trees/4abe6bd68683e236d4d132667340dd2d6a0d3e55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/git/commits/52babb9d7cce29229a8e418a387902cfc0859cff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5221275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marioserrano09","id":5221275,"login":"marioserrano09","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMjEyNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"h