ser_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/commits/6346744f8efe6fa5404f8a7141503bfa192d7300/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T05:13:59Z","email":"mario@dynamiasoluciones.com","name":"Mario Serrano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T05:13:59Z","email":"mario@dynamiasoluciones.com","name":"Mario Serrano"},"message":"test: migrate test suite from JUnit 4 to JUnit 5\n\nMigrates all test classes across platform/ and extensions/ to JUnit\nJupiter (imports, annotations, assertion argument order, @RunWith ->\n@ExtendWith, MockitoJUnitRunner -> MockitoExtension, JUnit3-style\nTestCase classes, @Test(expected=...) -> assertThrows).\n\n- Root pom.xml: junit:junit 4.13.2 -> org.junit.jupiter:junit-jupiter\n  (version managed by the spring-boot-dependencies BOM already\n  imported).\n- 7 extension poms with their own explicit junit dependency updated\n  the same way; saas-migration and http-functions-core gained explicit\n  mockito-junit-jupiter / hamcrest test dependencies that were\n  previously pulled in transitively via junit 4''s hamcrest-core.\n- EntityDependencyGraphTest and ImportPipelineMapperResolutionTest use\n  @MockitoSettings(strictness = LENIENT): their shared @BeforeEach stubs\n  more entities than every individual test consumes, which\n  MockitoExtension flags per-test (JUnit4''s MockitoJUnitRunner only\n  flagged it once at the class level).\n- Fixed CrudTestConfiguration: packagesToScan only listed\n  tools.dynamia.domain.jpa, so PersonEntity (in\n  tools.dynamia.app.crud) was never registered with Hibernate.\n  CrudServiceRestTest silently ran 0 tests before this migration\n  (surefire''s auto-detected JUnitPlatformProvider has no vintage\n  engine, so @RunWith(SpringRunner.class) tests were never executed)\n  masking this bug.\n\nVerified: full reactor test-compile + targeted [INFO] Scanning for projects...\n[INFO] Inspecting build with total of 50 modules\n[INFO] Installing Central Publishing features\n[INFO] ------------------------------------------------------------------------\n[INFO] Reactor Build Order:\n[INFO]\n[INFO] DynamiaTools                                                       [pom]\n[INFO] DynamiaTools - Commons                                             [jar]\n[INFO] DynamiaTools - Integration                                         [jar]\n[INFO] DynamiaTools - Actions                                             [jar]\n[INFO] DynamiaTools - Navigation                                          [jar]\n[INFO] DynamiaTools - IO                                                  [jar]\n[INFO] DynamiaTools - Templates                                           [jar]\n[INFO] DynamiaTools - Domain                                              [jar]\n[INFO] DynamiaTools - Domain JPA                                          [jar]\n[INFO] DynamiaTools - Viewers                                             [jar]\n[INFO] DynamiaTools - CRUD                                                [jar]\n[INFO] DynamiaTools - Web                                                 [jar]\n[INFO] DynamiaTools - Reports                                             [jar]\n[INFO] DynamiaTools - App                                                 [jar]\n[INFO] DynamiaTools - UI                                                  [jar]\n[INFO] DynamiaTools - ZK                                                  [jar]\n[INFO] DynamiaTools - ZK Starter                                          [jar]\n[INFO] DynamiaModules                                                     [pom]\n[INFO] DynamiaModules - Entity Files                                      [pom]\n[INFO] DynamiaModules - EntityFiles - Core                                [jar]\n[INFO] DynamiaModules - EntityFiles UI                                    [jar]\n[INFO] DynamiaModules - EntityFiles - S3                                  [jar]\n[INFO] DynamiaModules - SaaS                                             