il":"mario@dynamiasoluciones.com","name":"Mario Serrano"},"message":"test(web): add MicroFrontendView coverage\n\nCovers isServerResolved''s prefix detection, the classpath: happy path\n(src/css/bodyHtml extraction) and its failure modes (missing resource,\nrelative script src, no <script type=\"module\">), the view: path\nthrough a registered ViewResolver (including no resolver matching),\nand the unsupported-prefix rejection.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UeR9rN9UEmgyNpzMBctyV4","tree":{"sha":"2f88ed4f11ce1986980a88a2fe80f348d41a99e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/git/trees/2f88ed4f11ce1986980a88a2fe80f348d41a99e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/git/commits/8bac967762f4488796819aa6efb878b33a2ee34f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5221275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marioserrano09","id":5221275,"login":"marioserrano09","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMjEyNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dynamiatools/framework/commit/8bac967762f4488796819aa6efb878b33a2ee34f","node_id":"C_kwDOFLpEN9oAKDhiYWM5Njc3NjJmNDQ4ODc5NjgxOWFhNmVmYjg3OGIzM2EyZWUzNGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dynamiatools/framework/commit/a81310d793d0dd7e1459d908b3f0163b88f622d2","sha":"a81310d793d0dd7e1459d908b3f0163b88f622d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/commits/a81310d793d0dd7e1459d908b3f0163b88f622d2"}],"sha":"8bac967762f4488796819aa6efb878b33a2ee34f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/commits/8bac967762f4488796819aa6efb878b33a2ee34f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5221275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marioserrano09","id":5221275,"login":"marioserrano09","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMjEyNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/commits/a81310d793d0dd7e1459d908b3f0163b88f622d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T04:45:25Z","email":"mario@dynamiasoluciones.com","name":"Mario Serrano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T04:45:25Z","email":"mario@dynamiasoluciones.com","name":"Mario Serrano"},"message":"feat(microfrontend): resolve view:/classpath: app entries server-side\n\nMicroFrontend#setApp now accepts a \"view:\" or \"classpath:\" prefixed\nentry, resolved in-process by the new MicroFrontendView instead of\nrequiring the bundle''s index.html to be copied into\nsrc/main/resources/static/:\n\n- \"view:someapp/index\" resolves through the application''s registered\n  Spring ViewResolver chain (e.g. ClassPathViewResolver), so the\n  bundle can ship inside any module''s jar.\n- \"classpath:microfrontends/someapp/index.html\" reads a classpath\n  resource directly, bypassing the ViewResolver chain.\n\nBoth resolve within the current request/security context, so there is\nno dedicated HTTP endpoint. The resolved src/css/bodyHtml are sent to\nthe client already populated, so dynamiaMountMicrofrontend skips its\nown fetch-based discovery when config.src is present.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UeR9rN9UEmgyNpzMBctyV4","tree":{"sha":"1274d2defc5dc8fbaba44c9bc7419cc16249f7c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/git/trees/1274d2defc5dc8fbaba44c9bc7419cc16249f7c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/git/commits/a81310d793d0dd7e1459d908b3f0163b88f622d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5221275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marioserrano09","id":5221275,"login":"marioserrano09","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMjEyNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.