nThread via SchedulerUtil.runWithResult, returning a CompletableFuture so\ncallers can fire-and-forget or compose without blocking.\n\nFunctionResult gains isJson()/toJson()/toJson(Class<T>) so consumers don''t\nhave to deal with raw Map/String payloads directly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"474e78f9762e372d560c0a9544cd253473fa59fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/git/trees/474e78f9762e372d560c0a9544cd253473fa59fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dynamiatools/framework/git/commits/ed1e7b17644550529a620bac1c01880d8da5dc4e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5221275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marioserrano09","id":5221275,"login":"marioserrano09","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMjEyNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marioserrano09","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dynamiatools/framework/commit/ed1e7b17644550529a620bac1c01880d8da5dc4e","node_id":"C_kwDOFLpEN9oAKGVkMWU3YjE3NjQ0NTUwNTI5YTYyMGJhYzFjMDE4ODBkOGRhNWRjNGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dynamiatools/framework/commit/781c370c6208ca