://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oberhamberger/cohbrgr/commits/bd137ddd9f075d3a26a1cc6a5f8db12d684e948e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T14:36:20Z","email":"c.oberhamberger@gmail.com","name":"Christian Oberhamberger"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T14:36:20Z","email":"c.oberhamberger@gmail.com","name":"Christian Oberhamberger"},"message":"feat: give the site one accent colour, on the C·V·Q·O mark\n\nThe palette had no colour in it. It now has exactly one, and it lands on\nthe mark: #c40d2e on the light ground, #ff294f on the dark one.\n\nThe mark is 11.5px, which counts as small text under WCAG, so it needs\n4.5:1 rather than the 3:1 a decorative element gets. No single value\nclears that on both grounds, so the accent token ships as a pair. The\nfocus ring had no colour of its own and takes the accent too.\n\nContrast was measured rather than modelled. The glyphs are hidden and the\npixel behind them screenshotted, across five viewports on both pages. The\nworst ground is #1b1b1b, behind the mark on /codex at 360px, where the\ndark value reads 4.66:1.\n\nWhile measuring, `.codex p` turned out to outrank `[role=''doc-subtitle'']`\nand painted the mark back to ink on that page alone. No homepage\nassertion would have caught it, so e2e/specs/accent.spec.ts now checks\nthe computed colour on both pages in both themes.\n\nAlso in here:\n\n- Tone the dark ground down. Peaks drop about a fifth and the highlight\n  goes from 13% to 10%. That moved the worst measured ground, which is\n  why the dark red could step back down a notch.\n- Serve fonts with max-age=31536000, immutable. They carry no content\n  hash, because the preload in Index.html.tsx has to name the file\n  statically, so they are immutable by filename contract instead: a new\n  cut of the face ships under a new name.\n- Trim comments that narrate reasoning or restate the code. The ones that\n  record a constraint or a bug that would otherwise recur stay.","tree":{"sha":"680b4ef25b54577dfce57c751cd3b89908fcf525","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oberhamberger/cohbrgr/git/trees/680b4ef25b54577dfce57c751cd3b89908fcf525"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oberhamberger/cohbrgr/git/commits/bd137ddd9f075d3a26a1cc6a5f8db12d684e948e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8846578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oberhamberger","id":8846578,"login":"oberhamberger","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NDY1Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/oberhamberger/cohbrgr/commit/bd137ddd9f075d3a26a1cc6a5f8db12d684e948e","node_id":"C_kwDOFO40ItoAKGJkMTM3ZGRkOWYwNzVkM2EyNmE