unt":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T08:58:53Z","email":"c.oberhamberger@gmail.com","name":"Christian Oberhamberger"},"message":"chore(fonts): bundle the OFL texts alongside the font files\n\nBoth families are OFL 1.1, confirmed against the google/fonts repository rather\nthan from memory: ofl/ebgaramond and ofl/courierprime both declare license\n\"OFL\". The licence permits embedding and serving on the web, commercially\nincluded.\n\nThe gap was that the previous note only linked to the licence. OFL 1.1 requires\nthe copyright notice and the licence itself to accompany the Font Software\nwherever it is redistributed, and self-hosting is redistribution, so both texts\nare now checked in beside the woff2 files with the copyright holders named.\n\nNeither family asserts a Reserved Font Name, so subsetting would not force a\nrename. We use Google''s Latin subsets unmodified in any case.","tree":{"sha":"f59739264c42f62295698bfd04ddaf69c4b396f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oberhamberger/cohbrgr/git/trees/f59739264c42f62295698bfd04ddaf69c4b396f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oberhamberger/cohbrgr/git/commits/152f359393ac890bae829b464e9dd07dafded2f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8846578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oberhamberger","id":8846578,"login":"oberhamberger","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NDY1Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/obe