a094e1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oberhamberger/cohbrgr/commits/3f4fd28de2f2bf900c9e796803cb785eaa094e1c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8846578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oberhamberger","id":8846578,"login":"oberhamberger","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NDY1Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oberhamberger/cohbrgr/commits/bb07e579aef2d000f3509b45d959a5d41a3cd389/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T17:17:48Z","email":"c.oberhamberger@gmail.com","name":"Christian Oberhamberger"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T17:17:48Z","email":"c.oberhamberger@gmail.com","name":"Christian Oberhamberger"},"message":"test(e2e): add computed-style and screenshot regression coverage for scoped CSS\n\nNothing rendered the real page and inspected it, so the SSR CSS-module hash\nmismatch shipped undetected. Add two Playwright specs:\n\n- styling.spec.ts: computed-style assertions (nav display/list-style, layout\n  grid). Deterministic and OS-independent, so they run everywhere. Verified to\n  fail on the pre-fix build.\n- visual.spec.ts: full-page and navigation screenshot regression. Pixel\n  baselines are OS-specific, so they are generated for Linux (the CI platform)\n  and skipped elsewhere; local runs still get the computed-style guard.\n\nPin the CI e2e job to the Playwright image so CI renders identically to the\ncommitted Linux baselines, removing the separate setup-node and browser-install\nsteps (the image ships Node 24 and the browsers).","tree":{"sha":"5b6095c3784c1b744ab3eee5b3810e76a973780a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oberhamberger/cohbrgr/git/trees/5b6095c3784c1b744ab3eee5b3810e76a973780a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oberhamberger/cohbrgr/git/commits/bb07e579aef2d000f3509b45d959a5d41a3cd389","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8846578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oberhamberger","id":8846578,"login":"oberhamberger","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NDY1Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/oberhamberger/cohbrgr/commit/bb07e579aef2d000f3509b45d959a5d41a3cd389","node_id":"C_kwDOFO40ItoAKGJiMDdlNTc5YWVmMmQwMDBmMzUwOWI0NWQ5NTlhNWQ0MWEzY2QzODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/oberhamberger/cohbrgr/commit/4c368be763c0e9883286396d264bb25983eb277e","sha":"4c368be763c0e9883286396d264bb25983eb277e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oberhamberger/cohbrgr/commits/4c368be763c0e9883286396d264bb25983eb277e"}],"sha":"bb07e579aef2d000f3509b45d959a5d41a3cd389","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oberhamberger/cohbrgr/commits/bb07e579aef2d000f3509b45d959a5d41a3cd389"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8846578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oberhamberger","id":8846578,"login":"oberhamberger","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NDY1Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oberhamberger/cohbrgr/commits/4c368be763c0e9883286396d264bb25983eb277e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T17:17:36Z","email":"c.oberhamberger@gmail.com","name":"Christian Oberhamberger"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T17:17:36Z","email":"c.oberhamberger@gmail.com","name":"Christian Oberhamberger"},"message":"fix(build): align SSR and client CSS-module hashing so scoped styles apply\n\nrspack derives CSS-module local idents through two different code paths: a\nnode (server) build defaults to exportsOnly and emits only the name mappings,\nwhile a web (client) build emits a full stylesheet. The [hash] token comes out\ndifferent between them — even with a fixed localIdentHashSalt — so the SSR\nmarkup rendered navigation-<A> while the stylesheet only defined\n.navigation-<B>. Every module-scoped rule (navigation, spinner, layout) then\nsilently dropped on first paint; global element styles survived because they\nare not CSS-modules. The rspack 2.1.3 -> 2.1.5 bump tipped the two hashes apart.\n\nForcing exportsOnly: false routes the server through the same stylesheet\nhashing path as the client, so both emit an identical opaque hash. The server\nemits an unused .css file per chunk as a result; it is never served.","tree":{"sha":"106b8eb9796cc1f81f7b899d80ce5e734b889aa1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oberhamberger/cohbrgr/git/trees/106b8eb9796cc1f81f7b899d80ce5e734b889aa1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oberhamberger/cohbrgr/git/commits/4c368be763c0e9883286396d264bb25983eb277e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8846578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oberhamberger","id":8846578,"login":"oberhamberger","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NDY1Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.githu