er@gmail.com","name":"Christian Oberhamberger"},"message":"docs(adr): note that packages/jest is gone in ADR 0007\n\nThe Vitest migration removed packages/jest, which ADR 0007 cites twice as\na package exporting raw TypeScript. Recorded as a dated amendment rather\nthan an edit to the body, since ADRs document the state at decision time.\n\nWorth noting because the ADR''s own revisit trigger lists the friction\ninventory shrinking: the \"two packages export raw .ts\" objection is now\none, though not enough on its own to reconsider --legacy.","tree":{"sha":"c44a94fcc127e8338bf79a3b7414fa096e2491aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oberhamberger/cohbrgr/git/trees/c44a94fcc127e8338bf79a3b7414fa096e2491aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oberhamberger/cohbrgr/git/commits/278619eb61202f1c7349fd791f16614aee36b043","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8846578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oberhamberger","id":8846578,"login":"oberhamberger","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NDY1Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/oberhamberger/cohbrgr/commit/2