 Oberhamberger"},"message":"chore: rename rspack configs to .mts\n\nThe configs use ESM import/export syntax. Without the .mts extension\n(or ''type: module'' in package.json), Node parses them as CJS then\nre-parses as ESM when it sees import syntax, emitting a\nMODULE_TYPELESS_PACKAGE_JSON warning on every build. .mts is the\nnarrowest fix — keeps the rest of each app''s .js files as CJS.","tree":{"sha":"f8bd1cb9bfdda55ed8052f0893fd33db59ab350d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oberhamberger/cohbrgr/git/trees/f8bd1cb9bfdda55ed8052f0893fd33db59ab350d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oberhamberger/cohbrgr/git/commits/1a5d15dc85f892e5a1dfe4ac47ce955657854dd0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8846578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oberhamberger","id":8846578,"login":"oberhamberger","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NDY1Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oberhamberger","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/oberhamberger/cohbrgr/commit/1a5d15dc85f892e5a1dfe4ac47ce955657854dd0","node_id":"C_kwDOFO40ItoAKDFhNWQxNWRjODVmODkyZTVhMWRmZTRhYzQ3Y2U5NTU2NTc4NTRkZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https:/