epos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/cf5d6d86872d00983e4254d33dabbe498d375fd2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T14:10:36Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T14:10:36Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"AI: send the console language with the streaming calls\n\nBoth AI streams bypass the http interceptor that sets the Lang header - the chat\nruns on EventSource, which cannot set headers at all, and the field assistant\nreads its SSE frames off a raw fetch. Pass the language explicitly so the backend\ncan answer in it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1a86fa1b19707fef38ead7395454eccef106dd16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/1a86fa1b19707fef38ead7395454eccef106dd16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/cf5d6d86872d00983e4254d33dabbe498d375fd2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/cf5d6d86872d00983e4254d33dabbe498d375fd2","node_id":"C_kwDOFRe12toAKGNmNWQ2ZDg2ODcyZDAwOTgzZTQyNTRkMzNkYWJiZTQ5OGQzNzVmZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/36a92704fb7a77988918185d7f5c407970990740","sha":"36a92704fb7a77988918185d7f5c407970990740","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/36a92704fb7a77988918185d7f5c407970990740"}],"sha":"cf5d6d86872d00983e4254d33dabbe498d375fd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/cf5d6d86872d00983e4254d33dabbe498d375fd2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/36a92704fb7a77988918185d7f5c407970990740/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T13:09:58Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T13:09:58Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"AI assist: report each draft in a notification\n\nA draft streams into one field of a form that may well have scrolled past it,\nand nothing said when it landed or what it said. Each completed run now raises\na notification naming the field and quoting the opening of the draft.\n\nIt stays up for ten seconds rather than a toast''s few: this is a report to act\non, not a passing acknowledgement, and it has to outlive a glance away.\n\nOnly a run that finishes on its own reports. A draft the user stopped needs no\nnotice — they were watching it — and a failure already has its own message.\n\nThe excerpt is built for a host that binds content through innerHTML: rich text\nand markdown drafts lose their tags first, since the notice wants the words,\nplain fields keep every character they hold, and what survives is escaped.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a28abca66831e8ce80e4351d8ca750a78f9fcd66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/a28abca66831e8ce80e4351d8ca750a78f9fcd66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/36a92704fb7a77988918185d7f5c407970990740","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/36a92704fb7a77988918185d7f5c407970990740","node_id":"C_kwDOFRe12toAKDM2YTkyNzA0ZmI3YTc3OTg4OTE4MTg1ZDdmNWM0MDc5NzA5OTA3NDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/056bc344b78ac626a21b36684b33a42c496786d8","sha":"056bc344b78ac626a21b36684b33a42c496786d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/056bc344b78ac626a21b36684b33a42c496786d8"}],"sha":"36a92704fb7a77988918185d7f5c407970990740","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/36a92704fb7a77988918185d7f5c407970990740"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/056bc344b78ac626a21b36684b33a42c496786d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T13:09:51Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T13:09:51Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"AI assist: give the trigger a face\n\nThe button sat in an input''s suffix as a grey glyph on nothing, which read as a\nstray artifact rather than something to press. It now rests tinted and\naccent-coloured, with the glyph itself filled by an indigo-to-violet gradient —\nthe same ramp the panel''s send button already uses.\n\nAn SVG gradient can only be referenced by id, and a form renders one of these\nper text field. A shared id would resolve to whichever copy sits first in the\ndocument, so every other icon would lose its fill the moment that one unmounted\nwith its modal; each instance gets its own id instead. The stops carry no\ncolour of their own either: stop-color is read literally as a presentation\nattribute, so var() only lands through CSS, which is also what lets the dark\ntheme re-point both ends of the ramp.\n\nBoth variants now share one background treatment — they are one control at two\nsizes — which leaves the pill rule holding nothing but its own geometry.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9cdeb6973705e7c8ab71181769b414bdca275ac3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/9cdeb6973705e7c8ab71181769b414bdca275ac3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/056bc344b78ac626a21b36684b33a42c496786d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/056bc344b78ac626a21b36684b33a42c496786d8","node_id":"C_kwDOFRe12toAKDA1NmJjMzQ0Yjc4YWM2MjZhMjFiMzY2ODRiMzNhNDJjNDk2Nzg2ZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/733f6229b288016522f3807e6af6ad35b93bbe4e","sha":"733f6229b288016522f3807e6af6ad35b93bbe4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/733f6229b288016522f3807e6af6ad35b93bbe4e"}],"sha":"056bc344b78ac626a21b36684b33a42c496786d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/056bc344b78ac626a21b36684b33a42c496786d8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/733f6229b288016522f3807e6af6ad35b93bbe4e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T10:17:07Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T10:17:07Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"Menu: no default icon for top level menus\n\nA top level menu with no icon configured fell back to fa-list-ul, a\nfont-awesome glyph sitting in a column where every other icon is an\nant-design one. Leaving it empty reads better than filling it with a\nmismatched placeholder.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d5ce001466bea62b122f3cff7f09ab03a3de8cae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/d5ce001466bea62b122f3cff7f09ab03a3de8cae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/733f6229b288016522f3807e6af6ad35b93bbe4e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/733f6229b288016522f3807e6af6ad35b93bbe4e","node_id":"C_kwDOFRe12toAKDczM2Y2MjI5YjI4ODAxNjUyMmYzODA3ZTZhZjZhZDM1YjkzYmJlNGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/bc0ce55eca2273cd518c6935c0c87aaa04c18758","sha":"bc0ce55eca2273cd518c6935c0c87aaa04c18758","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/bc0ce55eca2273cd518c6935c0c87aaa04c18758"}],"sha":"733f6229b288016522f3807e6af6ad35b93bbe4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/733f6229b288016522f3807e6af6ad35b93bbe4e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/bc0ce55eca2273cd518c6935c0c87aaa04c18758/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T09:52:16Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T09:52:16Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"TPL field: let the template read and write the form around it\n\nA field-level TPL renders as an iframe whose backend entry point is handed no\ndata at all, so a template could never see the values of the fields next to it\n— the one escape hatch erupt offers for a custom editor was cut off from the\nform it lives in.\n\nThe iframe now carries a postMessage bridge. On load the form sends\nerupt-tpl:init with the full form object, mode and readonly flag, and pushes\nerupt-tpl:change on every subsequent edit, debounced off the ngDoCheck diff\nthat already drives $valueSubject. Coming back, erupt-tpl:get re-syncs, and\nerupt-tpl:set feeds straight into applyFormChange, so a template gets both\nformData and editExpr write-back for free — including its own value, which\nalready round-trips through the default branch of the data handler.\n\nMessages are matched against the iframes this component registered on load,\nnot just the origin: COMBINE and TAB_* nest several erupt-edit-type instances\nin one page, and without that check a child form''s write-back would land on\nits parent. The listener is only attached when the form actually holds a TPL\nfield, and detached frames are pruned before each push.\n\nerupt-tpl:height lets a template that grows after load size its own frame.\nIframeHeight keeps doing the initial measurement, but now reads event.target\ninstead of the deprecated event.path, and swallows the cross-origin throw.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cbbfd0d8114bd6af639a5c6588fa23d5d9723377","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/cbbfd0d8114bd6af639a5c6588fa23d5d9723377"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/bc0ce55eca2273cd518c6935c0c87aaa04c18758","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/bc0ce55eca2273cd518c6935c0c87aaa04c18758","node_id":"C_kwDOFRe12toAKGJjMGNlNTVlY2EyMjczY2Q1MThjNjkzNWMwYzg3YWFhMDRjMTg3NTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/d62941a2f5f9755b71f17e4630ba607aa8083f62","sha":"d62941a2f5f9755b71f17e4630ba607aa8083f62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/d62941a2f5f9755b71f17e4630ba607aa8083f62"}],"sha":"bc0ce55eca2273cd518c6935c0c87aaa04c18758","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/bc0ce55eca2273cd518c6935c0c87aaa04c18758"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/d62941a2f5f9755b71f17e4630ba607aa8083f62/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T12:55:02Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T12:55:02Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"Number field: stop the wheel from changing the value\n\nng-zorro''s nzChangeOnWheel defaults to true, so scrolling a long form with the\ncursor over a number input silently edits it. Turn it off for the NUMBER edit\ntype, where the input sits inline among other fields and is scrolled past far\nmore often than it is used.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ed5cb9d75d4146bb7b60a99529a73920d210e3cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/ed5cb9d75d4146bb7b60a99529a73920d210e3cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/d62941a2f5f9755b71f17e4630ba607aa8083f62","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/d62941a2f5f9755b71f17e4630ba607aa8083f62","node_id":"C_kwDOFRe12toAKGQ2Mjk0MWEyZjVmOTc1NWI3MWYxN2U0NjMwYmE2MDdhYTgwODNmNjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/a8107037a67321d806b44670e10376ba78742acc","sha":"a8107037a67321d806b44670e10376ba78742acc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/a8107037a67321d806b44670e10376ba78742acc"}],"sha":"d62941a2f5f9755b71f17e4630ba607aa8083f62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/d62941a2f5f9755b71f17e4630ba607aa8083f62"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/a8107037a67321d806b44670e10376ba78742acc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T12:54:26Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T12:54:26Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"Gantt: fetch the chart library only when a gantt view is opened\n\n@worktile/gantt is 126 KB and ships a single entry point, so any static\nreference drags all of it into whichever chunk holds that reference.\nGlobalConfigModule imported three tokens from it to register providers, and\nbeing an app-root module that put the whole library in the eager bundle — paid\nfor on the login screen — even though the gantt view itself is lazy.\n\nThe providers now sit on GanttComponent, which becomes standalone and is reached\nthrough a dynamic import in a small host shell. A @defer block cannot do this\njob: the table view is declared in an NgModule, and Angular only makes a\ndeferred dependency lazy when a standalone component imports it directly, so the\nlibrary stayed in the same chunk. The shell carries the same input and output\nsurface under the vis-gantt selector, and the table template is unchanged.\n\nInitial bundle drops 125 KB raw, and the erupt CRUD chunk another 126 KB on top\nof that, since the gantt no longer rides along with every table page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9d9ea03a369e3c8250decad72f07daf14d8f612","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/c9d9ea03a369e3c8250decad72f07daf14d8f612"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/a8107037a67321d806b44670e10376ba78742acc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/a8107037a67321d806b44670e10376ba78742acc","node_id":"C_kwDOFRe12toAKGE4MTA3MDM3YTY3MzIxZDgwNmI0NDY3MGUxMDM3NmJhNzg3NDJhY2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/074cd832035cf31e2f63010bfdfa538b7a32b76e","sha":"074cd832035cf31e2f63010bfdfa538b7a32b76e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/074cd832035cf31e2f63010bfdfa538b7a32b76e"}],"sha":"a8107037a67321d806b44670e10376ba78742acc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/a8107037a67321d806b44670e10376ba78742acc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/074cd832035cf31e2f63010bfdfa538b7a32b76e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T12:53:26Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T12:53:26Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"Micro frontend: iframe sandbox, one container per sub app, and a reason when it fails\n\nThe container ran on micro-app''s default `with` sandbox, which wraps sub-app\nscripts and evaluates them in the host window. A `type=\"module\"` script cannot\nbe wrapped that way — micro-app''s own source notes that proxyWindow does not\ntake effect under ESM — so a Vite-built sub app either failed outright or\nescaped the sandbox entirely. Switch to the iframe sandbox, where the sub app\ngets a real JS global.\n\nThe element carried a fixed name, so two micro-frontend menus open at once\ncollided under reuse-tab and the second never mounted. Derive the name from the\nsub-app url instead: distinct between sub apps, stable for one, which also lets\nkeep-alive resume a menu rather than reload it on every tab switch.\n\nBuild the element in code and set every attribute before inserting it. micro-app\nreads its options when the element connects, and the previous template-declared\nelement connected bare, leaving the mount dependent on attribute-change timing.\n\nA failed embed used to be a blank page. micro-app''s own message arrives on\ndetail.error of the element''s error event, and the url is re-fetched to tell\napart the cases it cannot distinguish: a CORS rejection, a non-2xx status, the\n200-with-404-body that erupt''s template engine returns for a missing file, and\na response that is not a complete HTML document. A sub app that mounts cleanly\nand still paints nothing — SSR streaming frameworks do exactly that — is called\nout after a grace period, and a late render clears the warning. The notice\nrenders above the container so it does not sit past the fold.\n\nAdd the mlink menu type: an external url opened in the micro-frontend container\nvia /msite/:url, base64-encoded the same way /site/:url already is. A full url\nin an mtpl menu value is chopped up by the router, which is how it ended up\nnavigating to #/tpl/https:.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aebea9dd49fa278d7cc4365f44cec52aef61a3c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/aebea9dd49fa278d7cc4365f44cec52aef61a3c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/074cd832035cf31e2f63010bfdfa538b7a32b76e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/074cd832035cf31e2f63010bfdfa538b7a32b76e","node_id":"C_kwDOFRe12toAKDA3NGNkODMyMDM1Y2YzMWUyZjYzMDEwYmZkZmE1MzhiN2EzMmI3NmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/d2da8864889ec838ab7b30a71e54cbe70f827a46","sha":"d2da8864889ec838ab7b30a71e54cbe70f827a46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/d2da8864889ec838ab7b30a71e54cbe70f827a46"}],"sha":"074cd832035cf31e2f63010bfdfa538b7a32b76e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/074cd832035cf31e2f63010bfdfa538b7a32b76e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/d2da8864889ec838ab7b30a71e54cbe70f827a46/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T12:18:57Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T12:18:57Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"Markdown field: fetch Vditor only when a form actually shows one\n\nThe editor was wired three wasteful ways at once. A static `import Vditor`\nput the 288 KB bundle into the erupt chunk, and the component then also\nlazy-loaded the same UMD file over the network. Vditor''s less was listed\ntwice in the global stylesheet, once in angular.json and once in\nstyles.less, so every page including login paid for it.\n\nNow the component keeps only a type-level import and pulls script and\nstylesheet from assets when it first renders, so a form without a markdown\nfield costs nothing. Built JS drops 288 KB and the styles bundle 5.3 KB\nof transfer.\n\nVditor asks its cdn path for katex, mermaid and five other renderers that\nwere never copied into libs/vditor, so formulas and diagrams failed\nsilently. Ship katex and mermaid; pin the highlight theme to github /\ngithub-dark and drop the other 74 themes, which were unreachable anyway.\n\nTrim the toolbar from 28 buttons to 13 with the rest folded into \"more\",\ndrop the default height from 480 to 360 and make it resizable, and restyle\nthe box as an ant-input with --erupt-* tokens. The upload control is a\n<div> while every other trigger is a <button>, and only a button centres\nits own content, so its icon sat 5.5px high: centre both with inline-flex.\n\nPin the editing surface colours to the tokens as well. Vditor''s index.css\nand its runtime content-theme css both set .vditor-reset colour at equal\nspecificity, and moving index.css out of the global bundle made that order\nunstable, which showed up as dark text on dark ground.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ffab95dcc4435148a5589d9bd77c4f3fc71ef5ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/ffab95dcc4435148a5589d9bd77c4f3fc71ef5ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/d2da8864889ec838ab7b30a71e54cbe70f827a46","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/d2da8864889ec838ab7b30a71e54cbe70f827a46","node_id":"C_kwDOFRe12toAKGQyZGE4ODY0ODg5ZWM4MzhhYjdiMzBhNzFlNTRjYmU3MGY4MjdhNDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/7b3124ce6151c806f2063baa92f7d239e4bc2b9b","sha":"7b3124ce6151c806f2063baa92f7d239e4bc2b9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/7b3124ce6151c806f2063baa92f7d239e4bc2b9b"}],"sha":"d2da8864889ec838ab7b30a71e54cbe70f827a46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/d2da8864889ec838ab7b30a71e54cbe70f827a46"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/7b3124ce6151c806f2063baa92f7d239e4bc2b9b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T12:12:42Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T12:12:42Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"Inline AI assistant on text form fields\n\nA trigger inside every text-bearing editor opens a command panel: generate,\npolish, continue, expand, shorten, plus a free-form instruction. The draft\nstreams straight into the field, is clipped to whatever length the component\nenforces, and one click puts the previous value back. Rich editors repaint\nwholesale, so their writes are batched rather than per-token.\n\nEach host keeps the assistant inside its own control instead of floating it\nover content: INPUT uses the suffix slot, TEXTAREA reserves a strip and shares\na tray with its character count, MARKDOWN and HTML_EDITOR get a tray pinned to\nthe editor''s corner, and CODE_EDITOR joins its existing button row. Only INPUT\nstays a bare glyph — its slot is too narrow for a word, and \"AI\" on the button\nis what makes the rest findable at all.\n\nThose rich editor hosts declared no display of their own, so they defaulted to\ninline and collapsed the wrapper their trays position against; each now sets\nit. The accent is a fixed violet rather than the runtime brand colour: it\nreads as AI under any theme and never collides with the site''s primary.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1296bb94cacf4e95242b3b3e2b0e91dbbb4f04ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/1296bb94cacf4e95242b3b3e2b0e91dbbb4f04ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/7b3124ce6151c806f2063baa92f7d239e4bc2b9b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/7b3124ce6151c806f2063baa92f7d239e4bc2b9b","node_id":"C_kwDOFRe12toAKDdiMzEyNGNlNjE1MWM4MDZmMjA2M2JhYTkyZjdkMjM5ZTRiYzJiOWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/34e7b514e08ca69aac8c557059ecce271f8c7401","sha":"34e7b514e08ca69aac8c557059ecce271f8c7401","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/34e7b514e08ca69aac8c557059ecce271f8c7401"}],"sha":"7b3124ce6151c806f2063baa92f7d239e4bc2b9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/7b3124ce6151c806f2063baa92f7d239e4bc2b9b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/34e7b514e08ca69aac8c557059ecce271f8c7401/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T14:40:00Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T14:40:00Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"Home: hand the welcome frame the host''s color-scheme\n\nDropping the frame''s background was not enough to see through it. A browser\nrenders an iframe''s canvas transparent only while the frame''s used\ncolor-scheme matches the embedder''s; mismatched, it paints an opaque Canvas\ncolor instead. So a dark shell embedding a light-scheme frame got a white\nsheet exactly where the shell''s surface was supposed to show, while the same\nframe was correctly see-through under a light shell — which is what made this\nlook like \"iframes cannot be transparent\".\n\nThe host sets the one property that decides it, on load and again whenever the\ntheme changes, so home.html stays free of any theme logic.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f39ec2bcf44ba252e1fc4a1dbc62b0ccfe495b9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/f39ec2bcf44ba252e1fc4a1dbc62b0ccfe495b9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/34e7b514e08ca69aac8c557059ecce271f8c7401","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/34e7b514e08ca69aac8c557059ecce271f8c7401","node_id":"C_kwDOFRe12toAKDM0ZTdiNTE0ZTA4Y2E2OWFhYzhjNTU3MDU5ZWNjZTI3MWY4Yzc0MDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/504d70dc5dfd5c171e4e940a4f1f9fdc1da2568d","sha":"504d70dc5dfd5c171e4e940a4f1f9fdc1da2568d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/504d70dc5dfd5c171e4e940a4f1f9fdc1da2568d"}],"sha":"34e7b514e08ca69aac8c557059ecce271f8c7401","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/34e7b514e08ca69aac8c557059ecce271f8c7401"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/504d70dc5dfd5c171e4e940a4f1f9fdc1da2568d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T14:20:00Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T14:20:00Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"Welcome page: drop its own backdrop\n\nThe frame painted a white rectangle over whatever the shell had drawn behind\nit, which was wrong under every theme, not just Liquid Glass — in dark mode it\nwas a white sheet in a dark app. It now has no background of its own at all;\nan iframe renders transparent when its document does, so the shell''s surface\nshows through in all three skins.\n\nThe illustration itself stays deliberately theme-agnostic, as it was written.\nThe sidebar panel''s hard-coded #fff becomes --paper, the one literal that\nescaped the original token pass; same color today, one less thing to find if\nthat ever changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"11787d76805a92658a1090fc537c957c3fe67fa7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/11787d76805a92658a1090fc537c957c3fe67fa7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/504d70dc5dfd5c171e4e940a4f1f9fdc1da2568d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/504d70dc5dfd5c171e4e940a4f1f9fdc1da2568d","node_id":"C_kwDOFRe12toAKDUwNGQ3MGRjNWRmZDVjMTcxZTRlOTQwYTRmMWY5ZmRjMWRhMjU2OGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/6c00bb5374e952f048bf37d2c83d53b1a365ae12","sha":"6c00bb5374e952f048bf37d2c83d53b1a365ae12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/6c00bb5374e952f048bf37d2c83d53b1a365ae12"}],"sha":"504d70dc5dfd5c171e4e940a4f1f9fdc1da2568d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/504d70dc5dfd5c171e4e940a4f1f9fdc1da2568d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/6c00bb5374e952f048bf37d2c83d53b1a365ae12/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:44:00Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:44:00Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"Login page: choose the skin and the theme color before signing in\n\nThe login screen carried a single brutalist on/off button, which cannot express\nthree mutually exclusive skins, and offered no way at all to set the brand\ncolor — so the first screen a user ever sees was the one screen they could not\nadjust. It now has a skin dropdown and a color picker, both in the nav pill\nbeside the existing dark-mode and language controls.\n\nThe palettes and the apply path move to @shared/util/theme.util and the\nsettings drawer is rewired to them, so the two pickers read from one list and\nwrite through one function instead of keeping parallel copies. Storage is\nuntouched: same localStorage keys, same NzConfigService call, so a color set\nhere is the one startup.service boots into after signing in.\n\nThe login page also gets a Liquid Glass block of its own. Without it the skin\nwas selectable there but invisible — the page paints its own artwork over the\nambient field — which made the new option look broken. Scoped in the component\nstylesheet rather than the theme file because the component''s :host-prefixed\nrules would otherwise win the specificity tie.\n\nbg-colors joins ICONS_AUTO; unlisted icons render blank with no build error.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9ca22b660ccc6e84c5e8d3786f690746bbb5eff9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/9ca22b660ccc6e84c5e8d3786f690746bbb5eff9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/6c00bb5374e952f048bf37d2c83d53b1a365ae12","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/6c00bb5374e952f048bf37d2c83d53b1a365ae12","node_id":"C_kwDOFRe12toAKDZjMDBiYjUzNzRlOTUyZjA0OGJmMzdkMmM4M2Q1M2IxYTM2NWFlMTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/a79c22fa6afe7aaa3fc3a113e5917f858ff0f421","sha":"a79c22fa6afe7aaa3fc3a113e5917f858ff0f421","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/a79c22fa6afe7aaa3fc3a113e5917f858ff0f421"}],"sha":"6c00bb5374e952f048bf37d2c83d53b1a365ae12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/6c00bb5374e952f048bf37d2c83d53b1a365ae12"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/a79c22fa6afe7aaa3fc3a113e5917f858ff0f421/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:20:00Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:20:00Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"Liquid Glass: take the ambient field from the theme color\n\nThe field was three fixed washes, so the glass ignored whatever brand color\nthe user had picked and the skin read as \"someone else''s blue\". The washes now\nderive from --ant-primary-color: the brand hue is the dominant one, and the\ntwo companions are that hue pulled halfway toward a warm and a cool neighbour\n— enough separation to read as a field rather than a flat tint, while still\nobviously one palette. The preloader gradient is built the same way off\n--pl-accent, so the splash already carries the brand color before Angular\nboots.\n\nThe welcome page drops its white backdrop under this skin. It is an iframe, so\nno CSS variable reaches it, but it is same-origin with the shell and can read\nthe skin flag from localStorage directly — applied in <head> so the white\nnever flashes first. An iframe renders transparent when its document does.\n\nAlso from wearing it for a while: corners down from 14px to 6px, the sidebar''s\nbottom utility bar gets its own denser pane of glass so menu rows scrolling\nunderneath dissolve instead of showing through, and the menu list gets 8px of\nbreathing room top and bottom — the first row was sitting on the panel edge.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"632dd2dd08018267dde8880c00609d1a63f924c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/632dd2dd08018267dde8880c00609d1a63f924c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/a79c22fa6afe7aaa3fc3a113e5917f858ff0f421","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/a79c22fa6afe7aaa3fc3a113e5917f858ff0f421","node_id":"C_kwDOFRe12toAKGE3OWMyMmZhNmFmZTdhYWEzZmMzYTExM2U1OTE3Zjg1OGZmMGY0MjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/12b48ccf87e5b8f2cc8ee75deda1cee8765f929f","sha":"12b48ccf87e5b8f2cc8ee75deda1cee8765f929f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/12b48ccf87e5b8f2cc8ee75deda1cee8765f929f"}],"sha":"a79c22fa6afe7aaa3fc3a113e5917f858ff0f421","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/a79c22fa6afe7aaa3fc3a113e5917f858ff0f421"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/12b48ccf87e5b8f2cc8ee75deda1cee8765f929f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T12:52:00Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T12:52:00Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"Liquid Glass skin, picked from a skin selector\n\nAn Apple-style translucent material. The sidebar becomes a real pane of glass\n— tint plus backdrop blur, a specular top edge, a soft wide shadow — floating\non an ambient color field, and the content area is inset by the same 8px\ngutter so the field shows through and fuses the two. Components inside the\ncontent are untouched; only the surface they sit on changes.\n\nTwo things in the shell fought back. @delon/abc pins the fixed tab bar with\n`top: 44px !important`, so any skin that moves the shell geometry needs\n!important of its own to place it. And backdrop-filter makes an element the\ncontaining block for its `position: fixed` descendants, which rules it out on\n.erupt_content — the fixed reuse-tab lives in there — so the content slab is\ntranslucent without blur.\n\nBrutalist and Liquid Glass are mutually exclusive, which two switches could\nonly express by calling each other, so they become one select. The pair of\nlocalStorage flags is written exactly as before: index.html reads them\npre-bootstrap, and eruptSiteConfig.brutalistTheme / .liquidGlass are\ndocumented site config, so neither contract moves.\n\nThe dark sidebar in light mode is removed: the html.aside-dark class, its\nlocalStorage and config flags, its i18n label, and the :not(.aside-dark)\nscoping it forced onto the other sidebar rules in tokens.less.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ad687cec5e17a01ee19ede2a9cae464ffd1a3cca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/ad687cec5e17a01ee19ede2a9cae464ffd1a3cca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/12b48ccf87e5b8f2cc8ee75deda1cee8765f929f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/12b48ccf87e5b8f2cc8ee75deda1cee8765f929f","node_id":"C_kwDOFRe12toAKDEyYjQ4Y2NmODdlNWI4ZjJjYzhlZTc1ZGVkYTFjZWU4NzY1ZjkyOWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/c0dee19b6ab4bd2c9ee44e826336977bd5cd4e2b","sha":"c0dee19b6ab4bd2c9ee44e826336977bd5cd4e2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/c0dee19b6ab4bd2c9ee44e826336977bd5cd4e2b"}],"sha":"12b48ccf87e5b8f2cc8ee75deda1cee8765f929f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/12b48ccf87e5b8f2cc8ee75deda1cee8765f929f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/c0dee19b6ab4bd2c9ee44e826336977bd5cd4e2b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T12:30:00Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T12:30:00Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"Font Awesome: move off the dead 4.7 package to 7.x\n\nThe `font-awesome` npm package stopped at 4.7.0 in 2016, so `^4.7.0` could\nnever resolve anything newer and the icon set was frozen at 675 glyphs. The\nmaintained package is `@fortawesome/fontawesome-free`, now at 7.3.1, which\ncarries 1992. That count is a product surface here, not an internal detail:\nEruptMenu.icon and the @Drill / @RowOperation defaults are `fa fa-*` strings\nthat users type themselves.\n\nv4-shims.min.css rides along with all.min.css so the legacy names keep\nresolving — renames map onto FA7 glyphs and the `-o` outline icons fall back\nto the regular weight. Of the 786 FA4 class names only `meanpath` and\n`tripadvisor` lose a glyph, and neither is used.\n\nOne visual change: FA7 gives every `.fa` a default width of 1.25em where FA4\nhad none, so icons now sit in a uniform box. Set `--fa-width: auto` to get the\nold metrics back.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"32e5ad163299c48cde44b016f9fee97365bb18cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/32e5ad163299c48cde44b016f9fee97365bb18cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/c0dee19b6ab4bd2c9ee44e826336977bd5cd4e2b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com