:{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/c9131456bb9d666e13d5b2d5609c24ffe8c86c45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:00:00Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:00:00Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"Designer: drop the field id when copying a field\n\nA copied field carried the source field''s backend id, so publish read it as a\nrename and moved the existing column''s data onto the copy instead of adding a\nnew one.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6ea3f25dca1701ae10d967b6cde4563adba2064a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/6ea3f25dca1701ae10d967b6cde4563adba2064a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/c9131456bb9d666e13d5b2d5609c24ffe8c86c45","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/c9131456bb9d666e13d5b2d5609c24ffe8c86c45","node_id":"C_kwDOFRe12toAKGM5MTMxNDU2YmI5ZDY2NmUxM2Q1YjJkNTYwOWMyNGZmZThjODZjNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/9dfd55f65d57770917fc2d132372b2d5729689d0","sha":"9dfd55f65d57770917fc2d132372b2d5729689d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/9dfd55f65d57770917fc2d132372b2d5729689d0"}],"sha":"c9131456bb9d666e13d5b2d5609c24ffe8c86c45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/c9131456bb9d666e13d5b2d5609c24ffe8c86c45"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/9dfd55f65d57770917fc2d132372b2d5729689d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:00:00Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:00:00Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"Inline cell editing in the table\n\nDouble-click a cell (or its edit icon) to change one field without opening the\nrow form. The floating editor is the row form''s own erupt-edit-type fed a\none-field model, so value conversion, validation and the reference pickers all\nbehave identically, and the write goes through a single-field update endpoint.\n\nOnly columns the row form would offer an enabled control for are editable, and\nonly view types the render template can reproduce; the list query does not\nselect collection fields, so the many-to-many editors stay out to avoid opening\nblank over real values. Gated per model by Power.cellEdit and per row by\n__power__.edit, with a designer switch to opt out.\n\nSince a render template bypasses the column format, the choice and boolean\ncolumns now key off the stored value everywhere instead of the label — the same\npayload the cell editor writes back.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b14aa03379394f145c656467f1af14b80c3072f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/b14aa03379394f145c656467f1af14b80c3072f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/9dfd55f65d57770917fc2d132372b2d5729689d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/9dfd55f65d57770917fc2d132372b2d5729689d0","node_id":"C_kwDOFRe12toAKDlkZmQ1NWY2NWQ1Nzc3MDkxN2ZjMmQxMzIzNzJiMmQ1NzI5Njg5ZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/d01a1207e36aeed80763624be2733050b0211762","sha":"d01a1207e36aeed80763624be2733050b0211762","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/d01a1207e36aeed80763624be2733050b0211762"}],"sha":"9dfd55f65d57770917fc2d132372b2d5729689d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/9dfd55f65d57770917fc2d132372b2d5729689d0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/d01a1207e36aeed80763624be2733050b0211762/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T13:05:00Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T13:05:00Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"Step validation: read MULTI_FORM emptiness from its live blocks\n\nThe required check on form steps looked at $value, which is the row list\nloaded at init; the blocks the user adds or removes live in $tempValue, so a\nrequired MULTI_FORM never counted as filled or empty correctly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6cc9180e1ec39663d62e877369f05678cc95f6f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/6cc9180e1ec39663d62e877369f05678cc95f6f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/d01a1207e36aeed80763624be2733050b0211762","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","org