s/erupts/erupt-web/commits/79cf59b58f466cd18ee56878ccf02da1c77c36e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T12:45:00Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T12:45:00Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"Designer: complete the component palette across every EditType\n\nAdd the six missing types: HIDDEN, EMPTY and TPL are usable (TPL gets a\npath/engine panel and a required-path check), AUTO_COMPLETE is usable with\npredefined values and trigger length now that the annotation supports them,\nwhile BUTTON and MULTI_FORM are listed greyed out with a tooltip explaining\nthey need a Java handler or a JPA relation. Add HIDDEN to the frontend\nEditType enum, which was missing, plus the i18n rows.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"47c26c70bd2a39b602bd957d7d3430f8eb16ffe4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/47c26c70bd2a39b602bd957d7d3430f8eb16ffe4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/79cf59b58f466cd18ee56878ccf02da1c77c36e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_ur