s://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/add8a938bb327e8079b05516a44a4d02eaba8157/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T15:50:21Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T15:50:21Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"Reuse tab: name non-menu page tabs after their data and close them on back\n\nPages opened from a row operation or a link (remote host session, AI canvas\ndesigner, cube dashboard designer, form designer) are not menu items, so\nreuse-tab fell back to showing the raw URL as the tab title. Once such a page\nhas loaded its data it now sets the tab title (host / canvas / dashboard /\nerupt name), also patching the cached list entry so the title survives\nleaving the page. Their back buttons return to the opener and drop the tab.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0036dc9b99f292277a7e318093a4e05c38e363dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/0036dc9b99f292277a7e318093a4e05c38e363dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/add8a938bb327e8079b05516a44a4d02eaba8157","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"htt