/commits/ebb44698c9de63981edcdfc39ba4576dd9ae5a8b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T14:45:10Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T14:45:10Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"AI canvas designer: drop SSE, follow every round through the running-marker poll\n\nGeneration used two code paths: an EventSource stream for rounds started here and a\npoll of /generating for rounds found running after a reload. Now send() only opens\nthe round (POST /generate returns at once) and follows it with the same poll; a\nmarker carrying `error` reports a failed round and restores the message to the input.\nThe live code tail is gone, the progress bubble keeps the spinner and elapsed time.\n\nAlso let the canvas and chat hosts shrink inside the layout flex column so the\nreuse-tab bar no longer pushes the sender toolbar off-screen.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f07d520905726c19fbc8b880f59a4c693c9c73ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/f07d520905726c19fbc8b880f59a4c693c9c73ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/ebb44698c9de63981edcdfc39ba4576dd9ae5a8b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/ebb44698c9de63981edcdfc39ba4576dd9ae5a8b","node_id":"C_kwDOFRe12toAKGViYjQ0Njk4YzlkZTYzOTgxZWRjZGZjMzliYTQ1NzZkZDlhZTVhOGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/141226ad72c801d97f935e68d9edf075ea19974d","sha":"141226ad72c801d97f935e68d9edf075ea19974d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/141226ad72c801d97f935e68d9edf075ea19974d"}],"sha":"ebb44698c9de63981edcdfc39ba4576dd9ae5a8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/ebb44698c9de63981edcdfc39ba4576dd9ae5a8b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/141226ad72c801d97f935e68d9edf075ea19974d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T14:24:01Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T14:24:01Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"Route loading: header-aware top shimmer bar, menu item spinner, busy cursor\n\nThe lazy-module progress bar was a 2px brand-colored strip at the top of the\nviewport, which disappeared whenever the header color was set to the theme color.\n\n- Top bar is now a 3px shimmer whose color comes from --erupt-header-progress;\n  applyHeaderColor() sets it to the header foreground (white on dark/colored\n  headers, ink on light ones) and it falls back to the brand color otherwise.\n- The clicked sidebar menu item shows an inline spinner in place of its pin\n  while its route loads (StatusService.routeLoading / pendingMenuLink).\n- <html> gets an erupt-route-loading class during navigation for a progress cursor.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"90491eb003e23e72b362c9be4b738ed758db3dc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/90491eb003e23e72b362c9be4b738ed758db3dc1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/141226ad72c801d97f935e68d9edf075ea19974d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/141226ad72c801d97f935e68d9edf075ea19974d","node_id":"C_kwDOFRe12toAKDE0MTIyNmFkNzJjODAxZDk3ZjkzNWU2OGQ5ZWRmMDc1ZWExOTk3NGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/a374c0affe2e7678d3cfeaf1ab6a6abb68c70a0e","sha":"a374c0affe2e7678d3cfeaf1ab6a6abb68c70a0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/a374c0affe2e7678d3cfeaf1ab6a6abb68c70a0e"}],"sha":"141226ad72c801d97f935e68d9edf075ea19974d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/141226ad72c801d97f935e68d9edf075ea19974d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/a374c0affe2e7678d3cfeaf1ab6a6abb68c70a0e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T12:28:59Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T12:28:59Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"Add remote host access pages for VNC and SSH sessions\n\nIntroduces a lazy-loaded remote module reachable at /remote/:id. The entry\nview requests a one-time session ticket to learn the host''s protocol, then\ndelegates to a noVNC-backed desktop view or an xterm-backed SSH view, both\nspeaking to the new /erupt-remote WebSocket endpoint. Owning the socket\ndirectly lets the backend close codes surface as readable messages instead of\nnoVNC''s clean/unclean flag. Ships local noVNC type declarations since the\npackage has none.","tree":{"sha":"15aff10ac05c20042990597f64fb817ba468ef85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/15aff10ac05c20042990597f64fb817ba468ef85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/a374c0affe2e7678d3cfeaf1ab6a6abb68c70a0e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/a374c0affe2e7678d3cfeaf1ab6a6abb68c70a0e","node_id":"C_kwDOFRe12toAKGEzNzRjMG