eaking to the new /erupt-remote WebSocket endpoint. Owning the socket\ndirectly lets the backend close codes surface as readable messages instead of\nnoVNC''s clean/unclean flag. Ships local noVNC type declarations since the\npackage has none.","tree":{"sha":"98d7decde5460b257d371c96ba669c4e0bd5df45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/98d7decde5460b257d371c96ba669c4e0bd5df45"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/3c5d210937bc44a4b4807c3acb775ec890fbe8ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/3c5d210937bc44a4b4807c3acb775ec890fbe8ef","node_id":"C_kwDOFRe12toAKDNjNWQyMTA5MzdiYzQ0YTRiNDgwN2MzYWNiNzc1ZWM4OTBmYmU4ZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/8bd4e30bd123000e9789416420466989450468d7","sha":"8bd4e30bd123000e9789416420466989450468d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/8bd4e30bd123000e9789416420466989450468d7"}],"sha":"3c5d210937bc44a4b4807c3acb775ec890fbe8ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/3c5d210937bc44a4b4807c3acb775ec890fbe8ef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/8bd4e30bd123000e9789416420466989450468d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T13:33:33Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T13:33:33Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"AI Canvas designer: surface page runtime errors and a running round\n\nThe canvas SDK relays errors out of the preview iframe; the designer shows them\nover the preview with a one-click action that sends them back as the next\nrequirement. Bound models now carry their allowed writes into the chip tooltip.\n\nA round already running when the designer opens is reattached from the backend\nmarker and polled to completion, because the token stream it was watching cannot\nbe resumed. Verification tool names are no longer shown while generating; the\nprogress bubble keeps only the spinner and the elapsed time.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"17dcbbe14210b3ef985e817d2fc9a451e8ad94e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/17dcbbe14210b3ef985e817d2fc9a451e8ad94e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/8bd4e30bd123000e9789416420466989450468d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/8bd4e30bd123000e9789416420466989450468d7","node_id":"C_kwDOFRe12toAKDhiZDRlMzBiZDEyMzAwMGU5Nzg5NDE2NDIwNDY2OTg5NDUwNDY4ZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/bb767f69190dfeb818882bada434b616f041f415","sha":"bb767f69190dfeb818882bada434b616f041f415","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/bb767f69190dfeb818882bada434b616f041f415"}],"sha":"8bd4e30bd123000e9789416420466989450468d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/8bd4e30bd123000e9789416420466989450468d7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/commits/bb767f69190dfeb818882bada434b616f041f415/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T12:06:45Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T12:06:45Z","email":"erupts@126.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"layout-tree: resolve add/edit/delete permission by the real tree erupt name\n\nThe link-tree action buttons were gated on menuSrv.getItem(fieldReturnName + ''@ADD''),\nwhich never matched: hidden button menus are keyed by their random code, while the\npermission string lives in menu.value, and fieldReturnName is the field''s return type\nrather than the model name.\n\nNow the tree build model is always fetched, its backend-resolved eruptName is used to\nbuild the permission value, and StatusService.hasMenuValue() matches it against the raw\nmenu list the same way the backend does (case-insensitive, query string ignored).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"74b97f93832041668bc0fefacf90b5bf1a022283","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-we