6.com","name":"YuePeng"},"message":"Fix fixed-mode multi-tab bar overlapping page content by ~2px\n\nThe reuse-tab renders 39px tall (38px nav + 1px bottom border) while its\nrouter-outlet placeholder was 38px and shrinkable inside the flex column,\nletting the fixed tab bar cover the content below.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"17c668510d15f2918d3918cb11997719197785c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/trees/17c668510d15f2918d3918cb11997719197785c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erupts/erupt-web/git/commits/5d5219a9f656539102f14071428f9f939ce63ffc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20358088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erupts","id":20358088,"login":"erupts","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzU4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erupts","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/5d5219a9f656539102f14071428f9f939ce63ffc","node_id":"C_kwDOFRe12toAKDVkNTIxOWE5ZjY1NjUzOTEwMmYxNDA3MTQyOGY5ZjkzOWNlNjNmZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/erupts/erupt-web/commit/5f7fa979268463b24013a339e12d5a79df898b74","sha":"5f7fa979268463b24013a339e12d5a79df898b74","url